  Sections:
  - Section: Mix
    Language: 6
    Items:
    - Key: No_Not_Don_t
      Language: 6
      Section: Mix
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Mix/No_Not_Don_t
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Mix/No_Not_Don_t
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Mix/No_Not_Don_t
      LearnWord: "\u0E44\u0E21\u0E48"
      Translation: No / Not / Don't
      Prompt: 'A big cream circle with an open palm ''stop'' hand in skin tone in
        the center, surrounded by a thick red ring like a prohibition sign. Background
        palette: rose.'
    - Key: Put_Add
      Language: 6
      Section: Mix
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Mix/Put_Add
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Mix/Put_Add
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Mix/Put_Add
      LearnWord: "\u0E43\u0E2A\u0E48"
      Translation: Put / Add
      Prompt: 'A teal bowl full of terracotta soup at the lower center, a large spoon
        reaching in from the upper right dropping small cream grains into it, and
        a big olive-green plus sign at the upper left. Background palette: sage.'
    - Key: Want
      Language: 6
      Section: Mix
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Mix/Want
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Mix/Want
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Mix/Want
      LearnWord: "\u0E2D\u0E22\u0E32\u0E01"
      Translation: Want
      Prompt: 'A man''s head and shoulders at the lower left with short dark hair
        and a blue top, eyes looking up and smiling, toward a cream thought cloud
        at upper right containing an ice cream cone with a mustard waffle cone and
        three scoops: pink, cream and green. Background palette: rose.'
    - Key: Buy
      Language: 6
      Section: Mix
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Mix/Buy
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Mix/Buy
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Mix/Buy
      LearnWord: "\u0E0B\u0E37\u0E49\u0E2D"
      Translation: Buy
      Prompt: 'A woman''s head and shoulders in the center with long dark hair, gold
        earrings, closed happy eyes and a teal top, holding a terracotta shopping
        bag with a cream heart logo in her lower left hand and raising her other
        hand with a gold baht coin at upper right. Background palette: beige.'
    - Key: Eat
      Language: 6
      Section: Mix
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Mix/Eat
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Mix/Eat
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Mix/Eat
      LearnWord: "\u0E01\u0E34\u0E19"
      Translation: Eat
      Prompt: 'A woman''s head with long dark hair, gold earrings, closed happy eyes,
        an open mouth and an olive-green top behind a large blue bowl filled with
        cream food in the foreground; a spoon is lifted from the bowl toward her
        mouth by her hand, and faint steam lines rise from the bowl. Background palette:
        sand.'
    - Key: Drink
      Language: 6
      Section: Mix
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Mix/Drink
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Mix/Drink
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Mix/Drink
      LearnWord: "\u0E14\u0E37\u0E48\u0E21"
      Translation: Drink
      Prompt: 'A man''s head and shoulders with short dark hair, closed happy eyes,
        a mustard top and a small round mouth sips through a bent red straw from
        a glass of orange-terracotta drink that he holds with one hand at the lower
        right. Background palette: sky.'
    - Key: Go
      Language: 6
      Section: Mix
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Mix/Go
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Mix/Go
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Mix/Go
      LearnWord: "\u0E44\u0E1B"
      Translation: Go
      Prompt: 'A full-body boy walking to the right on a faint ground line, wearing
        a terracotta top and dark brown trousers, with a large olive-green arrow
        pointing right in front of him. Background palette: sage.'
    - Key: Have_There is
      Language: 6
      Section: Mix
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Mix/Have_There is
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Mix/Have_There is
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Mix/Have_There is
      LearnWord: "\u0E21\u0E35"
      Translation: Have / There is
      Prompt: 'An open wooden crate with its side flaps folded out, filled with three
        round fruits (terracotta, olive green with a stem, mustard) peeking over
        the top, and a green circle badge with a cream checkmark at the upper right.
        Background palette: beige.'
    - Key: Be at_Located
      Language: 6
      Section: Mix
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Mix/Be at_Located
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Mix/Be at_Located
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Mix/Be at_Located
      LearnWord: "\u0E2D\u0E22\u0E39\u0E48"
      Translation: Be at / Located
      Prompt: 'A folded cream map in three panels with a blue river line and green
        road strokes, a large red map pin with a cream center standing in the middle,
        and a small standing boy figure in a teal top beside it at the right. Background
        palette: sage.'
    - Key: Question particle
      Language: 6
      Section: Mix
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Mix/Question particle
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Mix/Question particle
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Mix/Question particle
      LearnWord: "\u0E44\u0E2B\u0E21"
      Translation: Question particle
      Prompt: 'A large cream speech bubble with its tail pointing to the lower left,
        containing a huge terracotta question mark. Background palette: sky.'
    - Key: Very
      Language: 6
      Section: Mix
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Mix/Very
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Mix/Very
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Mix/Very
      LearnWord: "\u0E21\u0E32\u0E01"
      Translation: Very
      Prompt: 'A tall cream thermometer filled completely with red up to the top,
        with a red bulb at the bottom and tick marks on the right side, two wavy
        terracotta heat lines at its left and a big red double exclamation mark ''!!''
        at the right. Background palette: sand.'
    - Key: Half
      Language: 6
      Section: Mix
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Mix/Half
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Mix/Half
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Mix/Half
      LearnWord: "\u0E04\u0E23\u0E36\u0E48\u0E07"
      Translation: Half
      Prompt: 'The right half of an orange cut open, terracotta peel with light orange
        flesh and segment lines radiating from a cream center, while the missing
        left half is shown only as a faint dashed outline. Background palette: sand.'
  - Section: Gender
    Language: 6
    Items:
    - Key: _Polite male_
      Language: 6
      Section: Gender
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Gender/_Polite male_
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Gender/_Polite male_
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Gender/_Polite male_
      LearnWord: "\u0E04\u0E23\u0E31\u0E1A"
      Translation: '[Polite male]'
      Prompt: a man (neat side-parted dark hair, tan skin, blue collared shirt, brown
        trousers) standing on the left, palms pressed together at his chest in the
        Thai wai greeting, smiling. On the upper right, a large cream speech bubble
        from him containing a big icon of two hands pressed together in a wai with
        a cream cuff and gold radiating lines on both sides. Sky background.
    - Key: _Polite female_
      Language: 6
      Section: Gender
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Gender/_Polite female_
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Gender/_Polite female_
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Gender/_Polite female_
      LearnWord: "\u0E04\u0E48\u0E30"
      Translation: '[Polite female]'
      Prompt: a woman (long dark hair, gold earrings, red V-neck top, long purple
        skirt with a gold band) standing on the left, palms pressed together at her
        chest in the Thai wai greeting, smiling. On the upper right, a large cream
        speech bubble from her containing a big icon of two hands pressed together
        in a wai with a cream cuff and gold radiating lines on both sides. Rose background.
    - Key: _Man I_
      Language: 6
      Section: Gender
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Gender/_Man I_
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Gender/_Man I_
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Gender/_Man I_
      LearnWord: "\u0E1C\u0E21"
      Translation: '[Man I]'
      Prompt: a man (neat side-parted dark hair, tan skin, blue collared shirt, brown
        trousers) standing on the left with mouth open as if speaking, pointing at
        his own chest with his hand. On the upper right, a large cream speech bubble
        from him containing a small full-body copy of himself, also pointing at himself,
        meaning 'I / me'. Sky background.
    - Key: _Woman I_
      Language: 6
      Section: Gender
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Gender/_Woman I_
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Gender/_Woman I_
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Gender/_Woman I_
      LearnWord: "\u0E09\u0E31\u0E19"
      Translation: '[Woman I]'
      Prompt: a woman (long dark hair, gold earrings, red V-neck top, long purple
        skirt with a gold band) standing on the left with mouth open as if speaking,
        pointing at her own chest with her hand. On the upper right, a large cream
        speech bubble from her containing a small full-body copy of herself, also
        pointing at herself, meaning 'I / me'. Rose background.
  - Section: Food
    Language: 6
    Items:
    - Key: Fried rice
      Language: 6
      Section: Food
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Fried rice
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Fried rice
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Fried rice
      LearnWord: "\u0E02\u0E49\u0E32\u0E27\u0E1C\u0E31\u0E14"
      Translation: Fried rice
      Prompt: 'A cream plate holds a domed mound of golden-yellow fried rice dotted
        with pale rice grains, green and orange vegetable bits and yellow scrambled-egg
        pieces, with steam rising. A lime wedge sits on the right of the plate, a
        cucumber slice on the left, and a gray spoon leans in from the upper right.
        Background: sand.'
    - Key: Meat
      Language: 6
      Section: Food
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Meat
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Meat
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Meat
      LearnWord: "\u0E40\u0E19\u0E37\u0E49\u0E2D\u0E2A\u0E31\u0E15\u0E27\u0E4C"
      Translation: Meat
      Prompt: 'A large wooden cutting board holds an assortment of raw meats: a red
        steak with cream fat marbling on the left, a pink chicken drumstick with
        a white bone end at the upper right, a wavy strip of red and cream bacon
        along the bottom, and two dark red sausages on the right. Background: rose.'
    - Key: Pork
      Language: 6
      Section: Food
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Pork
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Pork
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Pork
      LearnWord: "\u0E2B\u0E21\u0E39"
      Translation: Pork
      Prompt: 'A cute pink pig standing in side view facing left, with a big round
        head, pointy ears, large darker pink snout with two nostrils, black dot eyes,
        rosy cheeks, small smile, four legs with brown hooves and a curly tail on
        the right. Background: rose.'
    - Key: Beef
      Language: 6
      Section: Food
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Beef
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Beef
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Beef
      LearnWord: "\u0E40\u0E19\u0E37\u0E49\u0E2D"
      Translation: Beef
      Prompt: 'A large rounded-rectangle wooden cutting board in tan-brown with a
        handle on the right fills the lower middle, holding a raw steak: dark red
        meat with a pale cream fat rim and wavy cream marbling streaks. In the upper
        right corner sits a round cream badge with a brown cow face (curved cream
        horns, brown ears, pink muzzle with two nostrils) to identify the meat as
        beef. Background: rose.'
    - Key: Chicken
      Language: 6
      Section: Food
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Chicken
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Chicken
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Chicken
      LearnWord: "\u0E44\u0E01\u0E48"
      Translation: Chicken
      Prompt: 'A wide cream plate in the lower half holds two raw pink chicken drumsticks
        with bumpy skin dots and white knobby bone ends pointing right, with a green
        leaf garnish at the left edge. In the upper right corner is a round cream
        badge with a white chicken head with a red comb, red wattle and orange beak,
        identifying the meat as chicken. Background: sage.'
    - Key: Fish
      Language: 6
      Section: Food
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Fish
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Fish
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Fish
      LearnWord: "\u0E1B\u0E25\u0E32"
      Translation: Fish
      Prompt: 'A whole orange-pink fish swims to the left across the center, with
        a cream belly, rows of faint scale arcs, a curved gill line, a big round
        white eye with a dark pupil, small mouth, and orange fins on top, bottom,
        side and a forked orange tail on the right. Background: sky.'
    - Key: Vegetable
      Language: 6
      Section: Food
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Vegetable
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Vegetable
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Vegetable
      LearnWord: "\u0E1C\u0E31\u0E01"
      Translation: Vegetable
      Prompt: 'A woven tan wicker basket in the lower half is filled with vegetables
        sticking out of the top: an orange carrot with green leaves on the left,
        a pale green cabbage in the middle, a purple eggplant on the right, a red
        tomato in the front left and a green broccoli on the front right. Background:
        sage.'
    - Key: Tomato
      Language: 6
      Section: Food
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Tomato
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Tomato
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Tomato
      LearnWord: "\u0E21\u0E30\u0E40\u0E02\u0E37\u0E2D\u0E40\u0E17\u0E28"
      Translation: Tomato
      Prompt: 'One big round red tomato fills the center, with a green star-shaped
        calyx and a short curved green stem on top, a white shine on the upper left
        and faint vertical ridge lines. Background: sage.'
    - Key: Potato
      Language: 6
      Section: Food
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Potato
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Potato
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Potato
      LearnWord: "\u0E21\u0E31\u0E19\u0E1D\u0E23\u0E31\u0E48\u0E07"
      Translation: Potato
      Prompt: 'Two whole tan-brown potatoes with small curved eye marks and dark
        speckles lie side by side, and in front of them at the bottom is a potato
        cut in half showing pale yellow flesh. Background: beige.'
    - Key: Chinese kale
      Language: 6
      Section: Food
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Chinese kale
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Chinese kale
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Chinese kale
      LearnWord: "\u0E04\u0E30\u0E19\u0E49\u0E32"
      Translation: Chinese kale
      Prompt: 'A bunch of Chinese kale stands upright: five pale green stalks rise
        from one point at the bottom center and fan out, each ending in a broad dark-to-medium
        green oval leaf with pale veins, and a red band ties the stalks together
        near the base. Background: sage.'
    - Key: Cabbage
      Language: 6
      Section: Food
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Cabbage
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Cabbage
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Cabbage
      LearnWord: "\u0E01\u0E30\u0E2B\u0E25\u0E48\u0E33\u0E1B\u0E25\u0E35"
      Translation: Cabbage
      Prompt: 'One big round head of cabbage fills the center: a ruffled darker-green
        outer leaf layer around a pale lime-green rounded head, with a lighter green
        folded leaf curling over its top and pale cream veins branching from a central
        rib. Background: sage.'
    - Key: Seasoning
      Language: 6
      Section: Food
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Seasoning
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Seasoning
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Seasoning
      LearnWord: "\u0E40\u0E04\u0E23\u0E37\u0E48\u0E2D\u0E07\u0E1B\u0E23\u0E38\u0E07"
      Translation: Seasoning
      Prompt: 'A Thai condiment caddy: a gray metal tray with a central handle ending
        in a ring holds four glass jars with small spoons. From left to right the
        jars contain white sugar, red chili flakes, brown fish sauce with red chili
        slices, and pale vinegar with green chili slices. Background: sand.'
    - Key: Chili
      Language: 6
      Section: Food
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Chili
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Chili
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Chili
      LearnWord: "\u0E1E\u0E23\u0E34\u0E01"
      Translation: Chili
      Prompt: 'Three large chili peppers hang side by side in a row across the image,
        each curving down to a pointed tip with a green stem and cap at the top:
        a red one on the left, a green one in the middle (slightly higher) and another
        red one on the right. Background: rose.'
    - Key: Pepper
      Language: 6
      Section: Food
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Pepper
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Pepper
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Pepper
      LearnWord: "\u0E1E\u0E23\u0E34\u0E01\u0E44\u0E17\u0E22"
      Translation: Pepper
      Prompt: 'A tall dark-brown wooden pepper grinder with a knob on top and gray
        metal rings at its top and bottom stands left of center. To its right on
        the ground lies a small scattered pile of round black peppercorns and some
        ground pepper specks. Background: beige.'
    - Key: Garlic
      Language: 6
      Section: Food
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Garlic
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Garlic
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Garlic
      LearnWord: "\u0E01\u0E23\u0E30\u0E40\u0E17\u0E35\u0E22\u0E21"
      Translation: Garlic
      Prompt: 'A large whole cream-white garlic bulb stands in the center with a
        pale stem on top, vertical clove lines, pale purple streaks on its sides
        and short root hairs at the bottom. A single separate garlic clove with a
        purple streak leans at the lower right. Background: beige.'
    - Key: Lime
      Language: 6
      Section: Food
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Lime
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Lime
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Lime
      LearnWord: "\u0E21\u0E30\u0E19\u0E32\u0E27"
      Translation: Lime
      Prompt: 'A whole round green lime sits right of center with two dark green
        leaves on top, and in front of it on the left lies a lime cut in half showing
        a pale green face with eight wedge-shaped segments around a light center.
        Background: sage.'
    - Key: Noodle soup
      Language: 6
      Section: Food
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Noodle soup
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Noodle soup
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Noodle soup
      LearnWord: "\u0E01\u0E4B\u0E27\u0E22\u0E40\u0E15\u0E35\u0E4B\u0E22\u0E27"
      Translation: Noodle soup
      Prompt: 'A big cream bowl with a red stripe band and a dashed red line around
        it, on a brown foot, is filled with orange-brown broth, yellow wavy noodles,
        round cream fish balls, pink meat slices, green onion bits and small green
        leaves, with steam rising. A pair of brown chopsticks sticks out diagonally
        to the upper right. Background: sage.'
    - Key: Spicy sour soup
      Language: 6
      Section: Food
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Spicy sour soup
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Spicy sour soup
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Spicy sour soup
      LearnWord: "\u0E15\u0E49\u0E21\u0E22\u0E33"
      Translation: Spicy sour soup
      Prompt: 'A gray metal pot with two side handles on a small base is filled with
        orange tom yum broth containing a stick of pale lemongrass, two orange shrimp,
        mushroom halves, dark green kaffir lime leaves and small red chili rings,
        with steam rising. A lime wedge lies at the lower left and a red chili at
        the lower right. Background: beige.'
    - Key: Stir fried noodles with peanuts
      Language: 6
      Section: Food
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Stir fried noodles with peanuts
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Stir fried noodles with peanuts
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Stir fried noodles with peanuts
      LearnWord: "\u0E1C\u0E31\u0E14\u0E44\u0E17\u0E22"
      Translation: Stir fried noodles with peanuts
      Prompt: 'An oval cream plate with a blue band holds pad thai: a pile of orange-brown
        flat noodles with yellow tofu cubes, white bean sprouts, green chive pieces
        and two orange shrimp, with a heap of crushed tan peanuts on the right side
        and a lime wedge at the front left. Background: sand.'
    - Key: Stir fried basil
      Language: 6
      Section: Food
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Stir fried basil
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Stir fried basil
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Stir fried basil
      LearnWord: "\u0E1C\u0E31\u0E14\u0E01\u0E30\u0E40\u0E1E\u0E23\u0E32"
      Translation: Stir fried basil
      Prompt: 'An oval cream plate with a blue band holds a mound of white rice on
        the left topped with a fried egg (white with crispy brown edge and orange
        yolk), and on the right a pile of brown minced pork stir-fried with green
        holy basil leaves and red chili pieces. A gray spoon sticks out at the lower
        right. Background: beige.'
    - Key: Stir fried mixed vegetables
      Language: 6
      Section: Food
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Stir fried mixed vegetables
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Stir fried mixed vegetables
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Stir fried mixed vegetables
      LearnWord: "\u0E1C\u0E31\u0E14\u0E1C\u0E31\u0E01\u0E23\u0E27\u0E21"
      Translation: Stir fried mixed vegetables
      Prompt: 'An oval cream plate with a teal band holds a brown sauce mound of
        colorful stir-fried vegetables: green broccoli florets, orange carrot rounds,
        yellow baby corn, green snow pea pods, brown mushroom slices, pale cabbage
        pieces and red pepper strips. Background: sage.'
    - Key: Green curry
      Language: 6
      Section: Food
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Green curry
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Green curry
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Green curry
      LearnWord: "\u0E41\u0E01\u0E07\u0E40\u0E02\u0E35\u0E22\u0E27\u0E2B\u0E27\u0E32\u0E19"
      Translation: Green curry
      Prompt: 'A brown clay bowl with two side loop handles sits in the center, filled
        with light green curry containing round pale eggplant slices, cream chicken
        cubes, red chili strips and small basil leaves, with steam rising above.
        A few large basil leaves lie on the ground beside the bowl at the lower left
        and lower right. Background: sage.'
    - Key: Papaya salad_Central Thai style_
      Language: 6
      Section: Food
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Papaya salad_Central Thai style_
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Papaya salad_Central Thai style_
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Papaya salad_Central Thai style_
      LearnWord: "\u0E2A\u0E49\u0E21\u0E15\u0E33\u0E44\u0E17\u0E22"
      Translation: Papaya salad (Central Thai style)
      Prompt: 'A brown clay mortar (krok) in the center is heaped with pale green
        shredded papaya mixed with orange carrot strands, red tomato wedges, short
        green long-bean pieces, tan peanuts and small orange dried shrimp, and a
        wooden pestle leans out to the upper right. A lime wedge sits at the lower
        left and one red and one green small chili lie at the lower right. Background:
        beige.'
    - Key: Fried egg
      Language: 6
      Section: Food
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Fried egg
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Fried egg
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Fried egg
      LearnWord: "\u0E44\u0E02\u0E48\u0E14\u0E32\u0E27"
      Translation: Fried egg
      Prompt: 'A blue plate with a lighter blue inner rim seen from above holds one
        large fried egg: irregular white with crispy golden-brown lacy edges and
        a round orange-yellow yolk slightly right of center with a white shine spot.
        Background: beige.'
    - Key: Omelette
      Language: 6
      Section: Food
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Omelette
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Omelette
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Omelette
      LearnWord: "\u0E44\u0E02\u0E48\u0E40\u0E08\u0E35\u0E22\u0E27"
      Translation: Omelette
      Prompt: 'An oval cream plate with a blue band holds a large fluffy golden-yellow
        Thai omelette with darker orange-brown crispy edges, lighter yellow center,
        brown spots and small green onion bits. On its right side lie green lettuce,
        a red tomato slice and a cucumber slice as garnish. Background: sky.'
    - Key: Boiled egg
      Language: 6
      Section: Food
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Boiled egg
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Boiled egg
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Boiled egg
      LearnWord: "\u0E44\u0E02\u0E48\u0E15\u0E49\u0E21"
      Translation: Boiled egg
      Prompt: 'A whole peeled white egg stands tilted in the middle, and in front
        of it lie two halves of a boiled egg seen from above: white oval with a round
        orange-yellow yolk with a lighter center. Two large green leaves lie flat
        underneath, one on the left and one on the right, as a garnish bed. Background:
        sand.'
    - Key: Shrimp
      Language: 6
      Section: Food
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Shrimp
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Shrimp
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Shrimp
      LearnWord: "\u0E01\u0E38\u0E49\u0E07"
      Translation: Shrimp
      Prompt: 'One large orange shrimp curled in a C shape fills the image: segmented
        body built of overlapping rounded sections, head on the left with a black
        shiny eye, a pointed rostrum and two long thin antennae sweeping upward,
        small legs underneath and a fan tail at the lower right. Background: sky.'
    - Key: Squid
      Language: 6
      Section: Food
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Squid
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Squid
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Squid
      LearnWord: "\u0E1B\u0E25\u0E32\u0E2B\u0E21\u0E36\u0E01"
      Translation: Squid
      Prompt: 'A front-facing cartoon squid stands upright: a tall pointed orange-pink
        mantle with side fins and darker spots on top, a round lighter head with
        two big white eyes and a small pink mouth, six wavy tentacles curling down
        underneath and two longer arms reaching to the lower left and right corners.
        Background: sky.'
    - Key: Crab
      Language: 6
      Section: Food
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Crab
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Crab
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Crab
      LearnWord: "\u0E1B\u0E39"
      Translation: Crab
      Prompt: 'A front-facing cartoon crab in orange-red in the center: rounded wide
        shell with faint pink spots and rosy cheeks, a small smile, two white eyes
        on stalks, two large raised pincer claws on either side and four jointed
        legs per side spreading downward. Background: sky.'
    - Key: Seafood
      Language: 6
      Section: Food
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Seafood
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Seafood
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Seafood
      LearnWord: "\u0E17\u0E30\u0E40\u0E25"
      Translation: Seafood
      Prompt: 'A large oval wooden platter lined with pale blue holds a mix of seafood:
        an orange-red crab in the center with two raised claws and eyes on stalks
        and three legs on each side, an orange shrimp curled on each side, two cream-tan
        ribbed clam shells at the bottom and a lime wedge in front. Background: sky.'
    - Key: Crispy pork
      Language: 6
      Section: Food
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Crispy pork
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Crispy pork
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Crispy pork
      LearnWord: "\u0E2B\u0E21\u0E39\u0E01\u0E23\u0E2D\u0E1A"
      Translation: Crispy pork
      Prompt: 'A wide cream plate holds two rows of chunky crispy pork cubes (moo
        krob) arranged tightly together: each cube has a crackling golden-brown skin
        top with small yellow bubbles, then pink meat with cream fat stripes. In
        the upper right a small cream dipping bowl holds dark brown sauce with red
        chili dots, and a green leaf lies at the right edge of the plate. Background:
        beige.'
    - Key: Minced pork
      Language: 6
      Section: Food
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Minced pork
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Minced pork
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Minced pork
      LearnWord: "\u0E2B\u0E21\u0E39\u0E2A\u0E31\u0E1A"
      Translation: Minced pork
      Prompt: 'A cream plate holds a mound of pink minced pork made of many small
        curly red, pink and pale strands, with green leaves on each side of the plate.
        In the upper right corner is a round cream badge with a pink pig face (pointy
        ears, snout with two nostrils, rosy cheeks) identifying the meat as pork.
        Background: rose.'
    - Key: Cucumber
      Language: 6
      Section: Food
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Cucumber
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Cucumber
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Cucumber
      LearnWord: "\u0E41\u0E15\u0E07\u0E01\u0E27\u0E32"
      Translation: Cucumber
      Prompt: 'A long dark-green cucumber with light green speckles lies diagonally
        from lower left to upper right, its cut end showing a pale green face. Three
        round cucumber slices are scattered at the lower right, each with a dark
        green rim, pale green flesh, a lighter center and a ring of small cream seeds.
        Background: sage.'
    - Key: Carrot
      Language: 6
      Section: Food
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Carrot
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Carrot
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Carrot
      LearnWord: "\u0E41\u0E04\u0E23\u0E4C\u0E23\u0E2D\u0E15"
      Translation: Carrot
      Prompt: 'A single large orange carrot lies diagonally, tip pointing to the
        lower right and green leafy top to the upper left, with three green stalks
        fanning out ending in leaves and small dark ridge lines across the root.
        Background: sand.'
    - Key: Onion
      Language: 6
      Section: Food
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Onion
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Onion
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Onion
      LearnWord: "\u0E2B\u0E2D\u0E21\u0E43\u0E2B\u0E0D\u0E48"
      Translation: Onion
      Prompt: 'A single large purple-red onion stands in the center with three green
        shoots growing from its top, faint curved layer lines on the bulb, a tan
        papery tip and small root hairs at the bottom. Background: sand.'
    - Key: Morning glory
      Language: 6
      Section: Food
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Morning glory
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Morning glory
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Morning glory
      LearnWord: "\u0E1C\u0E31\u0E01\u0E1A\u0E38\u0E49\u0E07"
      Translation: Morning glory
      Prompt: 'A bunch of morning glory (water spinach) stands upright: seven thin
        pale green stems rise from one point at the bottom center and fan out, each
        ending in a long narrow arrow-shaped green leaf with a pale midrib, and a
        red band ties the stems near the base. Background: sage.'
    - Key: Long bean
      Language: 6
      Section: Food
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Long bean
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Long bean
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Long bean
      LearnWord: "\u0E16\u0E31\u0E48\u0E27\u0E1D\u0E31\u0E01\u0E22\u0E32\u0E27"
      Translation: Long bean
      Prompt: 'A bundle of five very long, thin green beans in slightly different
        greens sweeps in an S-curve from the lower left up to the upper right, tied
        in the middle with a red band; faint dashed white highlights run along the
        beans. Background: sand.'
    - Key: Mushroom
      Language: 6
      Section: Food
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Mushroom
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Mushroom
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Mushroom
      LearnWord: "\u0E40\u0E2B\u0E47\u0E14"
      Translation: Mushroom
      Prompt: 'Two brown mushrooms: a large one in front on the left with a wide
        rounded brown cap, cream gill underside and a thick cream stem, and a smaller
        one behind it on the right. Two green leaves lie on the ground at the bottom
        left and right. Background: sage.'
    - Key: Fish sauce
      Language: 6
      Section: Food
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Fish sauce
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Fish sauce
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Fish sauce
      LearnWord: "\u0E19\u0E49\u0E33\u0E1B\u0E25\u0E32"
      Translation: Fish sauce
      Prompt: 'One tall glass bottle stands in the center: pale amber glass with
        a narrow neck and a green screw cap, the lower body filled with amber-brown
        fish sauce, and a cream label showing a simple orange fish icon framed by
        two red lines above and below. Background: sand.'
    - Key: Sugar
      Language: 6
      Section: Food
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Sugar
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Sugar
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Sugar
      LearnWord: "\u0E19\u0E49\u0E33\u0E15\u0E32\u0E25"
      Translation: Sugar
      Prompt: 'A purple bowl with a cream stripe is heaped with white sugar and has
        a gray spoon sticking out to the upper right. Three white sugar cubes are
        stacked beside the bowl on the right. Background: rose.'
    - Key: Vinegar
      Language: 6
      Section: Food
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Vinegar
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Vinegar
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Vinegar
      LearnWord: "\u0E19\u0E49\u0E33\u0E2A\u0E49\u0E21\u0E2A\u0E32\u0E22\u0E0A\u0E39"
      Translation: Vinegar
      Prompt: 'A round-bellied clear glass bottle with a tan cork cap stands left
        of center, its lower half filled with pale golden vinegar. To the right a
        small cream bowl with a blue stripe holds yellow vinegar with green chili
        slices. Background: beige.'
    - Key: Salt
      Language: 6
      Section: Food
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Salt
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Salt
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Salt
      LearnWord: "\u0E40\u0E01\u0E25\u0E37\u0E2D"
      Translation: Salt
      Prompt: 'A tall white salt shaker with a gray metal top pierced with five holes
        stands left of center, half filled with white salt. To the right lies a small
        white heap of salt with gray specks, with a few small white salt crystal
        cubes scattered around. Background: sky.'
    - Key: Soy sauce
      Language: 6
      Section: Food
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Soy sauce
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Soy sauce
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Soy sauce
      LearnWord: "\u0E0B\u0E2D\u0E2A\u0E16\u0E31\u0E48\u0E27\u0E40\u0E2B\u0E25\u0E37\u0E2D\u0E07"
      Translation: Soy sauce
      Prompt: 'A dark brown, almost black soy sauce bottle with a red cap stands
        left of center, with a cream label with a red top stripe showing a brown
        soybean. To the right a small cream dipping bowl with a blue stripe holds
        dark brown soy sauce. Background: beige.'
    - Key: Light soy sauce
      Language: 6
      Section: Food
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Light soy sauce
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Light soy sauce
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Light soy sauce
      LearnWord: "\u0E0B\u0E35\u0E2D\u0E34\u0E4A\u0E27\u0E02\u0E32\u0E27"
      Translation: Light soy sauce
      Prompt: 'A glass bottle with a red cap stands left of center, filled with medium-brown
        sauce, its cream label showing a green soybean pod with three pale beans
        between two green lines. To the right a small cream saucer holds a pool of
        brown sauce. Background: beige.'
    - Key: Spicy
      Language: 6
      Section: Food
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Spicy
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Spicy
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Spicy
      LearnWord: "\u0E40\u0E1C\u0E47\u0E14"
      Translation: Spicy
      Prompt: 'Three orange-and-yellow flames rise behind a large red chili pepper
        on the left whose green stem points to the upper left, with a yellow and
        an orange four-point sparkle nearby. The flames dominate the center-right,
        conveying burning hotness. Background: rose.'
    - Key: Not spicy
      Language: 6
      Section: Food
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Not spicy
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Not spicy
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Not spicy
      LearnWord: "\u0E44\u0E21\u0E48\u0E40\u0E1C\u0E47\u0E14"
      Translation: Not spicy
      Prompt: 'A red chili pepper with a green stem is shown in the center behind
        a big red prohibition sign: a thick red circle with a red diagonal slash
        from upper left to lower right crossing over the chili. Background: sage.'
    - Key: A little spicy
      Language: 6
      Section: Food
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/A little spicy
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/A little spicy
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/A little spicy
      LearnWord: "\u0E40\u0E1C\u0E47\u0E14\u0E19\u0E34\u0E14\u0E2B\u0E19\u0E48\u0E2D\u0E22"
      Translation: A little spicy
      Prompt: 'A wide cream oval plate with a beige inner well sits low in the center,
        holding one small red chili with a green stem lying diagonally on its left
        side, while a small orange-and-yellow flame floats just above the plate to
        the right of the chili. The picture is mostly empty space so the chili and
        flame read as small and mild. Background: sand.'
    - Key: Delicious
      Language: 6
      Section: Food
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Delicious
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Delicious
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Delicious
      LearnWord: "\u0E2D\u0E23\u0E48\u0E2D\u0E22"
      Translation: Delicious
      Prompt: 'A happy person''s face (peach skin, dark brown hair) fills the upper
        half with eyes squeezed shut in delight, pink cheeks and an open dark red
        smiling mouth with a pink tongue licking the corner of the lips. Below is
        a red bowl of yellow noodles with two wooden chopsticks sticking out to the
        right, and yellow and orange four-point sparkles surround the scene. Background:
        beige.'
    - Key: Rice
      Language: 6
      Section: Food
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Rice
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Rice
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Rice
      LearnWord: "\u0E02\u0E49\u0E32\u0E27"
      Translation: Rice
      Prompt: 'A blue rice bowl with cream polka dots and a cream stripe on a darker
        blue foot is heaped with a dome of white steamed rice showing faint grain
        outlines, with three wavy steam lines rising above. Background: beige.'
    - Key: Taste
      Language: 6
      Section: Food
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Taste
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Taste
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Food/Taste
      LearnWord: "\u0E0A\u0E34\u0E21"
      Translation: Taste
      Prompt: 'A person''s face (peach skin, dark brown hair, eyebrows raised, round
        dark eyes, open mouth) leans toward a spoon of orange soup held up by a hand
        at the lower right, tasting it, with a teal shirt at the bottom. A yellow
        and an orange sparkle float at the sides. Background: sky.'
  - Section: HowToCook
    Language: 6
    Items:
    - Key: Soft boil
      Language: 6
      Section: HowToCook
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/HowToCook/Soft boil
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/HowToCook/Soft boil
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/HowToCook/Soft boil
      LearnWord: "\u0E25\u0E27\u0E01"
      Translation: Soft boil
      Prompt: 'A soft-boiled egg sits in an orange-terracotta egg cup: the egg''s
        top is cut off, showing a runny orange yolk spilling over the white side.
        A gray spoon stands upright to the right of the cup. Background: sand.'
    - Key: Boil
      Language: 6
      Section: HowToCook
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/HowToCook/Boil
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/HowToCook/Boil
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/HowToCook/Boil
      LearnWord: "\u0E15\u0E49\u0E21"
      Translation: Boil
      Prompt: 'A big gray metal pot with two brown side handles sits on three blue
        gas flames at the bottom, its water surface in light blue full of white bubbles,
        with three wavy steam lines rising above. Background: sky.'
    - Key: Spicy sour soup
      Language: 6
      Section: HowToCook
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/HowToCook/Spicy sour soup
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/HowToCook/Spicy sour soup
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/HowToCook/Spicy sour soup
      LearnWord: "\u0E15\u0E49\u0E21\u0E22\u0E33"
      Translation: Spicy sour soup
      Prompt: 'A rust-orange bowl on a brown foot is filled with orange tom yum soup
        containing two pale lemongrass stalks, two orange shrimp, cream mushroom
        halves, dark green leaves and red chili pieces, with three steam lines rising.
        Background: rose.'
    - Key: Spicy sour salad
      Language: 6
      Section: HowToCook
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/HowToCook/Spicy sour salad
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/HowToCook/Spicy sour salad
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/HowToCook/Spicy sour salad
      LearnWord: "\u0E22\u0E33"
      Translation: Spicy sour salad
      Prompt: 'A wide oval cream plate seen from a low angle holds a mound of pale
        green shredded papaya (som tam) with thin green strands, mixed with green
        long-bean pieces, red tomato wedges, round red chili slices with yellow centers
        and tan peanuts. A lime wedge lies tilted at the right edge of the plate.
        Background: sand.'
    - Key: Stir fry
      Language: 6
      Section: HowToCook
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/HowToCook/Stir fry
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/HowToCook/Stir fry
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/HowToCook/Stir fry
      LearnWord: "\u0E1C\u0E31\u0E14"
      Translation: Stir fry
      Prompt: 'A dark wok with a long black handle on the left is tilted slightly
        over three blue gas flames, with green vegetables in it, while pieces of
        food fly up in an arc above it: an orange carrot slice, a green leaf, a red
        tomato, a green broccoli floret and a yellow piece, with motion lines tracing
        the toss. Background: sage.'
    - Key: Deep fry
      Language: 6
      Section: HowToCook
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/HowToCook/Deep fry
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/HowToCook/Deep fry
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/HowToCook/Deep fry
      LearnWord: "\u0E17\u0E2D\u0E14"
      Translation: Deep fry
      Prompt: 'A dark wok with two wooden side handles sits on three blue gas flames,
        filled with golden yellow oil in which three golden spring rolls are frying
        among white bubbles, with two faint steam lines above. Background: sand.'
    - Key: Curry
      Language: 6
      Section: HowToCook
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/HowToCook/Curry
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/HowToCook/Curry
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/HowToCook/Curry
      LearnWord: "\u0E41\u0E01\u0E07"
      Translation: Curry
      Prompt: 'A cream bowl with a blue stripe on a brown foot is filled with olive-green
        Thai green curry containing cream chicken cubes, green eggplant slices, red
        chili strips and basil leaves, with a white coconut-milk swirl and three
        steam lines rising. Background: sage.'
    - Key: Grill
      Language: 6
      Section: HowToCook
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/HowToCook/Grill
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/HowToCook/Grill
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/HowToCook/Grill
      LearnWord: "\u0E22\u0E48\u0E32\u0E07"
      Translation: Grill
      Prompt: 'A charcoal grill in the center: a dark brown body on legs with glowing
        orange coals and small flames under a gray grate, on which lie two wooden
        skewers loaded with brown meat chunks alternating with green pepper, yellow
        and red pieces, with two faint smoke lines above. Background: rose.'
    - Key: Toast
      Language: 6
      Section: HowToCook
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/HowToCook/Toast
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/HowToCook/Toast
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/HowToCook/Toast
      LearnWord: "\u0E1B\u0E34\u0E49\u0E07"
      Translation: Toast
      Prompt: 'A blue toaster in the center with two dark slots, a yellow lever on
        the right side and a cream button on the front, with two golden-brown slices
        of bread popping up out of the slots, tilted slightly apart, and yellow sparkles
        in the upper corners. Background: beige.'
    - Key: Bake
      Language: 6
      Section: HowToCook
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/HowToCook/Bake
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/HowToCook/Bake
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/HowToCook/Bake
      LearnWord: "\u0E2D\u0E1A"
      Translation: Bake
      Prompt: 'A red oven on short legs fills the center: a darker red control panel
        on top with two cream dials and a dark display with three yellow lights,
        a brown door handle, and a large glowing yellow-orange window through which
        a golden-brown loaf of bread is seen baking on a rack. Background: beige.'
  - Section: Months
    Language: 6
    Items:
    - Key: Month
      Language: 6
      Section: Months
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Months/Month
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Months/Month
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Months/Month
      LearnWord: "\u0E40\u0E14\u0E37\u0E2D\u0E19"
      Translation: Month
      Prompt: 'A calendar page with three gray binder rings on top, a red header
        band and a cream body with seven small blue weekday markers and a grid of
        dark brown day numbers 1 to 31; day 15 is highlighted with a red circle and
        cream number. Background: sky.'
