      Language: 6
      Section: Months
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Months/January
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Months/January
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Months/January
      LearnWord: "\u0E21\u0E01\u0E23\u0E32\u0E04\u0E21"
      Translation: January
      Prompt: 'A wall-calendar page with two gray binder rings on top, a blue header
        band showing the big cream number "1", and a dark navy lower area showing
        New Year fireworks at night: a big yellow burst, a pink burst and a light
        blue burst with small cream stars. Background: sky.'
    - Key: February
      Language: 6
      Section: Months
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Months/February
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Months/February
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Months/February
