        breezy sky with white clouds and wind lines. Background: sage.'
    - Key: March
      Language: 6
      Section: Months
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Months/March
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Months/March
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Months/March
      LearnWord: "\u0E21\u0E35\u0E19\u0E32\u0E04\u0E21"
      Translation: March
      Prompt: 'A wall-calendar page with two gray binder rings on top, a red header
