        beans scattered on the ground on both sides. Beige background.
    - Key: Tea
      Language: 6
      Section: Beverages
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Beverages/Tea
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Beverages/Tea
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Beverages/Tea
