      Language: 6
      Section: Beverages
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Beverages/Red wine
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Beverages/Red wine
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Beverages/Red wine
      LearnWord: "\u0E44\u0E27\u0E19\u0E4C\u0E41\u0E14\u0E07"
