      Language: 6
      Section: Beverages
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Beverages/Small
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Beverages/Small
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Beverages/Small
      LearnWord: "\u0E40\u0E25\u0E47\u0E01"
      Translation: Small
      Prompt: 'Three identical clear plastic Thai cafe takeaway cups (domed lid,
