  - Section: Greeting
    Language: 6
    Items:
    - Key: Bye_Informal_
      Language: 6
      Section: Greeting
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Greeting/Bye_Informal_
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Greeting/Bye_Informal_
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Greeting/Bye_Informal_
      LearnWord: "\u0E1A\u0E32\u0E22\u0E1A\u0E32\u0E22"
      Translation: Bye (Informal)
      Prompt: 'Two full-body figures: on the left a woman with long dark hair, gold
        stud earrings and a terracotta top and plum skirt stands waving with closed
        happy eyes; on the right a man with short dark hair and a blue collared shirt
        and dark brown trousers walks away to the right while waving back. Motion
        lines between them and a teal arrow pointing right along the bottom right.
        Background palette: sky.'
    - Key: I am leaving_I have to go_
      Language: 6
      Section: Greeting
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Greeting/I am leaving_I have to go_
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Greeting/I am leaving_I have to go_
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Greeting/I am leaving_I have to go_
      LearnWord: "\u0E44\u0E1B\u0E01\u0E48\u0E2D\u0E19\u0E19\u0E30"
      Translation: I am leaving, I have to go.
      Prompt: 'A full-body a man with short dark hair and a blue collared shirt and
        dark brown trousers walks right toward a dark brown door at the right edge,
        waving back with a small round open mouth. A cream speech bubble at upper
        left shows a clock with the hands near twelve (about 11:55), a teal arrow
        points right along the bottom and motion lines trail behind him. Background
        palette: sand.'
    - Key: I went_I went to_
      Language: 6
      Section: Greeting
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Greeting/I went_I went to_
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Greeting/I went_I went to_
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Greeting/I went_I went to_
      LearnWord: "\u0E44\u0E1B...\u0E21\u0E32"
      Translation: I went... / I went to...
      Prompt: 'A Thai temple with red and mustard tiered roofs and a cream base at
        the left, with a small green checkmark above it, and faint footprints along
        the bottom leading from it to the right. Waist-up smiling a man with short
        dark hair and a blue collared shirt on the right points upward; at the top
        right a clock at 9 o''clock is circled by a plum curved arrow turning backward
        (counter-clockwise) to mean the past. Background palette: sage.'
    - Key: Where did you go_Where are you coming from_
      Language: 6
      Section: Greeting
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Greeting/Where did you go_Where are you coming from_
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Greeting/Where did you go_Where are you coming from_
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Greeting/Where did you go_Where are you coming from_
      LearnWord: "...\u0E44\u0E1B\u0E44\u0E2B\u0E19 \u0E21\u0E32"
      Translation: "Where did you go? / \nWhere are you coming from?"
      Prompt: 'A small Thai temple with red and mustard roofs at the far left, faint
        footprints leading from it toward a full-body a man with short dark hair
        and a blue collared shirt in the middle who walks and waves. On the right
        a waist-up a woman with long dark hair, gold stud earrings and a terracotta
        top with a small round open mouth asks, her cream speech bubble above showing
        a red map pin and a red question mark. Background palette: beige.'
    - Key: How is it going_
      Language: 6
      Section: Greeting
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Greeting/How is it going_
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Greeting/How is it going_
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Greeting/How is it going_
      LearnWord: "\u0E40\u0E1B\u0E47\u0E19\u0E44\u0E07\u0E1A\u0E49\u0E32\u0E07"
      Translation: How is it going?
      Prompt: 'Waist-up a woman with long dark hair, gold stud earrings and a terracotta
        top on the left gestures with an open palm toward smiling waist-up a man
        with short dark hair and a blue collared shirt on the right. Her cream speech
        bubble contains a semicircular mood gauge with red, mustard and green sections
        and a dark needle pointing up-right toward the yellow-green zone, plus a
        big red question mark. Background palette: sage.'
    - Key: Safe travel
      Language: 6
      Section: Greeting
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Greeting/Safe travel
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Greeting/Safe travel
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Greeting/Safe travel
      LearnWord: "\u0E40\u0E14\u0E34\u0E19\u0E17\u0E32\u0E07\u0E1B\u0E25\u0E2D\u0E14\u0E20\u0E31\u0E22"
      Translation: Safe travel
      Prompt: 'A cream airplane with blue wings and tail climbs diagonally across
        the upper center, with a faint dotted trail at the left. A terracotta suitcase
        with handle and straps sits at the lower left and a teal shield with a cream
        heart at the lower right. Background palette: sky.'
    - Key: Have you eaten yet_
      Language: 6
      Section: Greeting
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Greeting/Have you eaten yet_
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Greeting/Have you eaten yet_
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Greeting/Have you eaten yet_
      LearnWord: "\u0E01\u0E34\u0E19\u0E02\u0E49\u0E32\u0E27\u0E41\u0E25\u0E49\u0E27\u0E2B\u0E23\u0E37\u0E2D\u0E22\u0E31\u0E07"
      Translation: Have you eaten yet?
      Prompt: 'Waist-up a woman with long dark hair, gold stud earrings and a terracotta
        top on the left gestures with an open palm toward waist-up a man with short
        dark hair and a blue collared shirt on the right, who has a small round open
        mouth. A large cream speech bubble from the woman shows a steaming bowl of
        white rice (cream bowl with a blue stripe) with wooden chopsticks and a big
        red question mark. Background palette: sand.'
    - Key: I have eaten_already_
      Language: 6
      Section: Greeting
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Greeting/I have eaten_already_
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Greeting/I have eaten_already_
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Greeting/I have eaten_already_
      LearnWord: "\u0E01\u0E34\u0E19\u0E41\u0E25\u0E49\u0E27"
      Translation: I have eaten (already)
      Prompt: 'Waist-up a man with short dark hair and a blue collared shirt on the
        left, happy with closed eyes and an open smile, rests a hand on a big round
        blue belly bulging in front of him. At the right a cream bowl with only a
        beige empty surface and wooden chopsticks, with a large green checkmark above
        it. Background palette: sand.'
    - Key: Go home safely
      Language: 6
      Section: Greeting
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Greeting/Go home safely
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Greeting/Go home safely
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Greeting/Go home safely
      LearnWord: "\u0E01\u0E25\u0E31\u0E1A\u0E1A\u0E49\u0E32\u0E19\u0E43\u0E2B\u0E49\u0E14\u0E35\u0E14\u0E35\u0E19\u0E30"
      Translation: Go home safely
      Prompt: 'A cream house with a red roof, brown door and light-blue windows stands
        at the right, with a small teal shield with a cream heart above it. A small
        full-body happy a man with short dark hair and a blue collared shirt walks
        and waves at the left, and a faint dotted path curves from the lower left
        to the house. Background palette: sage.'
    - Key: I am about to go home_
      Language: 6
      Section: Greeting
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Greeting/I am about to go home_
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Greeting/I am about to go home_
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Greeting/I am about to go home_
      LearnWord: "\u0E01\u0E25\u0E31\u0E1A\u0E1A\u0E49\u0E32\u0E19\u0E01\u0E48\u0E2D\u0E19\u0E19\u0E30"
      Translation: I am about to go home.
      Prompt: 'A wide cream speech bubble across the top shows a clock reading 5
        o''clock, a teal arrow pointing right, and a small cream house with a red
        roof. Below on the left a waist-up smiling a man with short dark hair and
        a blue collared shirt points upward toward the bubble, and a brown wooden
        briefcase-like bag with a handle sits at the lower right. Background palette:
        rose.'
    - Key: I will go_I am going to_
      Language: 6
      Section: Greeting
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Greeting/I will go_I am going to_
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Greeting/I will go_I am going to_
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Greeting/I will go_I am going to_
      LearnWord: "\u0E1C\u0E21/\u0E09\u0E31\u0E19 \u0E08\u0E30\u0E44\u0E1B..."
      Translation: I will go / I am going to ...
      Prompt: 'Waist-up smiling a man with short dark hair and a blue collared shirt
        on the left points toward a Thai temple with red and mustard tiered roofs
        on the right. A teal arrow along the bottom points right toward the temple,
        and at the top left a clock at 3 o''clock is circled by a plum curved arrow
        turning forward (clockwise) to mean the future. Background palette: sage.'
    - Key: Where are you going_
      Language: 6
      Section: Greeting
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Greeting/Where are you going_
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Greeting/Where are you going_
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Greeting/Where are you going_
      LearnWord: "...(\u0E04\u0E38\u0E13) \u0E44\u0E1B\u0E44\u0E2B\u0E19"
      Translation: Where are you going?
      Prompt: 'A full-body a man with short dark hair and a blue collared shirt and
        dark brown trousers stands at the left with a hand on his chin and a small
        round open mouth, with a small cream speech bubble above him holding a red
        question mark. On the right a tall wooden signpost carries three arrow boards:
        mustard pointing right, teal pointing left and red pointing right. Background
        palette: sky.'
    - Key: Drive safe
      Language: 6
      Section: Greeting
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Greeting/Drive safe
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Greeting/Drive safe
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Greeting/Drive safe
      LearnWord: "\u0E02\u0E31\u0E1A\u0E23\u0E16\u0E43\u0E2B\u0E49\u0E14\u0E35"
      Translation: Drive safe
      Prompt: 'A red car with light-blue windows drives along a grey road with a
        dashed cream center line across the bottom, a smiling short-haired man''s
        face visible in the car window and motion lines behind it at the left. Above
        the car floats a large teal shield with a cream heart in the middle. Background
        palette: sky.'
    - Key: May I be excused_Formal_
      Language: 6
      Section: Greeting
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Greeting/May I be excused_Formal_
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Greeting/May I be excused_Formal_
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Greeting/May I be excused_Formal_
      LearnWord: "\u0E02\u0E2D\u0E15\u0E31\u0E27\u0E01\u0E48\u0E2D\u0E19\u0E19\u0E30"
      Translation: May I be excused? (Formal)
      Prompt: 'Waist-up a woman with long dark hair, gold stud earrings and a terracotta
        top on the right bows slightly with her head tilted and palms pressed together
        in a Thai wai. A cream speech bubble at upper left shows a small brown door
        with a teal arrow pointing out and a red question mark. Background palette:
        rose.'
    - Key: See you again_See you later
      Language: 6
      Section: Greeting
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Greeting/See you again_See you later
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Greeting/See you again_See you later
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Greeting/See you again_See you later
      LearnWord: "(\u0E41\u0E25\u0E49\u0E27)\u0E40\u0E08\u0E2D\u0E01\u0E31\u0E19\u0E43\u0E2B\u0E21\u0E48"
      Translation: See you again, See you later
      Prompt: 'Waist-up a woman with long dark hair, gold stud earrings and a terracotta
        top on the left and a man with short dark hair and a blue collared shirt
        on the right, both happy with closed eyes, wave to each other. A cream speech
        bubble above holds a calendar with a red header, grey rings and dotted days
        with one red highlighted day, encircled by a teal curved arrow. Background
        palette: rose.'
    - Key: I_m not_so_good
      Language: 6
      Section: Greeting
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Greeting/I_m not_so_good
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Greeting/I_m not_so_good
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Greeting/I_m not_so_good
      LearnWord: "\u0E44\u0E21\u0E48\u0E04\u0E48\u0E2D\u0E22\u0E14\u0E35"
      Translation: I'm not (so) good
      Prompt: 'Waist-up a woman with long dark hair, gold stud earrings and a terracotta
        top on the right looks sad with worried slanted brows and a downturned mouth.
        A cream speech bubble at upper left shows a pale grey-blue sad smiley, and
        a grey rain cloud with blue rain streaks floats at the upper right. Background
        palette: sky.'
    - Key: I_m sick
      Language: 6
      Section: Greeting
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Greeting/I_m sick
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Greeting/I_m sick
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Greeting/I_m sick
      LearnWord: "\u0E44\u0E21\u0E48\u0E2A\u0E1A\u0E32\u0E22"
      Translation: I'm sick
      Prompt: 'A large waist-up a man with short dark hair and a blue collared shirt
        with a greenish-tinted face, closed line eyes, worried brows and a wavy mouth
        holds his hand to his chin, a small thermometer sticking out of his mouth
        and a light-blue sweat drop on his forehead. To the right a cream speech
        bubble shows a big white thermometer with a red bulb and red mercury, and
        a light-blue drop floats at the left. Background palette: sage.'
    - Key: So so
      Language: 6
      Section: Greeting
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Greeting/So so
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Greeting/So so
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Greeting/So so
      LearnWord: "\u0E40\u0E23\u0E37\u0E48\u0E2D\u0E22\u0E46"
      Translation: So so
      Prompt: 'Waist-up a man with short dark hair and a blue collared shirt on the
        right with a neutral face and straight flat mouth holds one hand out flat,
        palm down, as in a so-so gesture. A cream speech bubble at upper left contains
        a mustard smiley with a straight flat mouth; two faint small curved marks
        at the lower right. Background palette: beige.'
    - Key: I am good
      Language: 6
      Section: Greeting
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Greeting/I am good
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Greeting/I am good
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Greeting/I am good
      LearnWord: "\u0E2A\u0E1A\u0E32\u0E22\u0E14\u0E35"
      Translation: I am good
      Prompt: 'A large waist-up a man with short dark hair and a blue collared shirt
        in the center with a big open smile gives a thumbs-up with one hand and rests
        the other hand on his hip. Mustard sparkles around him and a small red heart
        at the lower left. Background palette: sage.'
    - Key: How are you_
      Language: 6
      Section: Greeting
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Greeting/How are you_
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Greeting/How are you_
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Greeting/How are you_
      LearnWord: "\u0E2A\u0E1A\u0E32\u0E22\u0E14\u0E35\u0E44\u0E2B\u0E21"
      Translation: How are you?
      Prompt: 'Waist-up a woman with long dark hair, gold stud earrings and a terracotta
        top on the left gestures with an open palm toward smiling waist-up a man
        with short dark hair and a blue collared shirt on the right. A large cream
        speech bubble from the woman contains a mustard-yellow smiley face and a
        big red question mark. Background palette: sky.'
    - Key: Good bye_Formal_
      Language: 6
      Section: Greeting
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Greeting/Good bye_Formal_
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Greeting/Good bye_Formal_
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Greeting/Good bye_Formal_
      LearnWord: "\u0E2A\u0E27\u0E31\u0E2A\u0E14\u0E35"
      Translation: Good bye (Formal)
      Prompt: 'A full-body a woman with long dark hair, gold stud earrings and a
        terracotta top and plum skirt on the left bows politely with her head tilted,
        palms pressed together at her chest in a Thai wai, eyes closed. On the right
        stands a dark brown open door with a lighter wooden panel and a teal arrow
        pointing out to the right; faint arcs above her head and a small mustard
        sparkle between them. Background palette: rose.'
    - Key: Hi
      Language: 6
      Section: Greeting
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Greeting/Hi
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Greeting/Hi
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Greeting/Hi
      LearnWord: "\u0E27\u0E48\u0E32\u0E44\u0E07"
      Translation: Hi
      Prompt: 'Waist-up a woman with long dark hair, gold stud earrings and a terracotta
        top on the left and a man with short dark hair and a blue collared shirt
        on the right, both with big open happy smiles, each waving one raised open
        hand toward the other. Small curved motion lines between their waving hands
        and three mustard-yellow four-point sparkles above the center. Background
        palette: sky.'
    - Key: Not yet
      Language: 6
      Section: Greeting
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Greeting/Not yet
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Greeting/Not yet
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Greeting/Not yet
      LearnWord: "\u0E22\u0E31\u0E07"
      Translation: Not yet
      Prompt: 'Waist-up smiling a woman with long dark hair, gold stud earrings and
        a terracotta top on the right raises an open palm in a ''wait/stop'' gesture.
        A cream speech bubble at upper left contains an hourglass with wooden caps
        and mustard-yellow sand mostly in the upper bulb. Background palette: sand.'
    - Key: I haven_t eaten yet
      Language: 6
      Section: Greeting
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Greeting/I haven_t eaten yet
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Greeting/I haven_t eaten yet
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Greeting/I haven_t eaten yet
      LearnWord: "\u0E22\u0E31\u0E07\u0E44\u0E21\u0E48\u0E44\u0E14\u0E49\u0E01\u0E34\u0E19"
      Translation: I haven't eaten yet
      Prompt: 'Waist-up a woman with long dark hair, gold stud earrings and a terracotta
        top on the left looks hungry with worried brows and a small round open mouth,
        a hand on her belly. A cream speech bubble at upper right holds a steaming
        bowl of white rice, an empty cream bowl sits at the lower right, and red
        zigzag rumble lines appear on both sides of her lower body. Background palette:
        beige.'
