        green circle badge with a cream checkmark at the upper right, plus a mustard
        sparkle at upper left. Background palette: sage.'
    - Key: Cannot
      Language: 6
      Section: Shopping
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Shopping/Cannot
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Shopping/Cannot
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Shopping/Cannot
      LearnWord: "\u0E44\u0E21\u0E48\u0E44\u0E14\u0E49"
      Translation: Cannot
      Prompt: 'A big thumbs-down hand with a blue sleeve at the top pointing downward,
        and a large red circle badge with a cream X at the lower right. Background
        palette: rose.'
    - Key: Beautiful
      Language: 6
      Section: Shopping
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Shopping/Beautiful
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Shopping/Beautiful
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Shopping/Beautiful
      LearnWord: "\u0E2A\u0E27\u0E22"
      Translation: Beautiful
      Prompt: 'A large woman''s head and shoulders in the center with long dark hair,
        gold earrings, a plum top, closed happy eyes and a smile, a pink five-petal
        flower with a mustard center tucked by her hair at upper right. Mustard sparkles
        of various sizes surround her. Background palette: rose.'
    - Key: Fit perfect
      Language: 6
      Section: Shopping
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Shopping/Fit perfect
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Shopping/Fit perfect
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Shopping/Fit perfect
      LearnWord: "\u0E1E\u0E2D\u0E14\u0E35"
      Translation: Fit perfect
      Prompt: 'A large man''s head and shoulders in the center with short dark hair,
        closed happy eyes and a smile, wearing a teal top with a button line and
        two cream buttons down the front. A green circle badge with a cream checkmark
        at upper right and mustard sparkles around him. Background palette: sky.'
    - Key: Big
      Language: 6
      Section: Shopping
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Shopping/Big
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Shopping/Big
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Shopping/Big
      LearnWord: "\u0E43\u0E2B\u0E0D\u0E48"
      Translation: Big
      Prompt: 'A large teal T-shirt dominates the left side next to a tiny faded,
        semi-transparent teal T-shirt at the lower right. Two terracotta arrows at
        the top of the big shirt point diagonally outward (up-left and up-right)
        to show expansion. Background palette: sky.'
    - Key: Small
      Language: 6
      Section: Shopping
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Shopping/Small
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Shopping/Small
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Shopping/Small
      LearnWord: "\u0E40\u0E25\u0E47\u0E01"
      Translation: Small
      Prompt: 'A large faded, semi-transparent teal T-shirt on the left and a small
        solid teal T-shirt highlighted on the right, with a terracotta arrow pointing
        down at the small shirt. Background palette: sky.'
    - Key: Too much
      Language: 6
      Section: Shopping
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Shopping/Too much
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Shopping/Too much
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Shopping/Too much
      LearnWord: "\u0E40\u0E01\u0E34\u0E19\u0E44\u0E1B"
      Translation: Too much
      Prompt: 'A dashed horizontal limit line across the middle, a short faded stack
        of gold coins on the left below the line, and a very tall stack of gold coins
        on the right rising above the line with a red tint over the part above it,
        plus a big red exclamation mark at the right. Background palette: rose.'
    - Key: Change to
      Language: 6
      Section: Shopping
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Shopping/Change to
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Shopping/Change to
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Shopping/Change to
      LearnWord: "\u0E40\u0E1B\u0E25\u0E35\u0E48\u0E22\u0E19\u0E40\u0E1B\u0E47\u0E19"
      Translation: Change to
      Prompt: 'A red T-shirt on the left and a teal T-shirt on the right, with two
        thick mustard curved arrows, one arcing over the top from left to right and
        one under the bottom from right to left, forming a swap cycle. Background
        palette: beige.'
    - Key: A classifier for clothes
      Language: 6
      Section: Shopping
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Shopping/A classifier for clothes
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Shopping/A classifier for clothes
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Shopping/A classifier for clothes
      LearnWord: "\u0E15\u0E31\u0E27"
      Translation: A classifier for clothes
      Prompt: 'A wooden clothes rack with a horizontal rail across the top holds
        three T-shirts on hangers side by side: red, teal and mustard. Below each
        shirt is a small cream circle with a dark numeral 1, 2 and 3. Background
        palette: sand.'
    - Key: Lower
      Language: 6
      Section: Shopping
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Shopping/Lower
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Shopping/Lower
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Shopping/Lower
      LearnWord: "\u0E25\u0E14"
      Translation: Lower
      Prompt: "A faded red price tag with three baht signs (\u0E3F\u0E3F\u0E3F) at
        upper left, a thick olive-green curved arrow sweeping down on the right,
        and a highlighted olive-green price tag with a single baht sign at lower
        center-right. Background palette: sage."
    - Key: Pay
      Language: 6
      Section: Shopping
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Shopping/Pay
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Shopping/Pay
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Shopping/Pay
      LearnWord: "\u0E08\u0E48\u0E32\u0E22"
      Translation: Pay
      Prompt: 'An arm in a blue sleeve reaches in from the lower left holding a green
        banknote with a baht sign, and a mustard arrow points right toward a teal
        cash register with a dark brown display with green screen, cream keys and
        a wooden drawer. A gold baht coin floats above. Background palette: beige.'
    - Key: Price
      Language: 6
      Section: Shopping
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Shopping/Price
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Shopping/Price
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Shopping/Price
      LearnWord: "\u0E23\u0E32\u0E04\u0E32"
      Translation: Price
      Prompt: 'A large teal T-shirt on the left with a mustard price tag showing
        a cream baht sign attached by a string, tag tilted at the right. Background
        palette: sand.'
    - Key: How much
      Language: 6
      Section: Shopping
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Shopping/How much
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Shopping/How much
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Shopping/How much
      LearnWord: "\u0E40\u0E17\u0E48\u0E32\u0E44\u0E2B\u0E23\u0E48"
      Translation: How much
      Prompt: 'A woman''s head and shoulders at lower left with long dark hair, gold
        earrings and a terracotta top, eyes looking up and a small round open mouth.
        A cream speech bubble at upper right contains a mustard baht sign and a terracotta
        question mark. Background palette: rose.'
    - Key: Expensive
      Language: 6
      Section: Shopping
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Shopping/Expensive
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Shopping/Expensive
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Shopping/Expensive
      LearnWord: "\u0E41\u0E1E\u0E07"
      Translation: Expensive
      Prompt: "Two stacks of gold coins (a tall one and a shorter one) with a green
        banknote bearing a baht sign in front, a red price tag with three baht signs
        (\u0E3F\u0E3F\u0E3F) at upper left, a red arrow pointing up at the right
        and a small gold baht coin at the lower right. Background palette: sand."
    - Key: Cheap
      Language: 6
      Section: Shopping
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Shopping/Cheap
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Shopping/Cheap
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Shopping/Cheap
      LearnWord: "\u0E16\u0E39\u0E01"
      Translation: Cheap
      Prompt: "An olive-green price tag tilted slightly with a cream baht sign (\u0E3F)
        at upper center, a single gold baht coin below it, a faded tall stack of
        gold coins in the background at the left, and an olive-green arrow pointing
        down at the right. Background palette: sage."
    - Key: Kilogram
      Language: 6
      Section: Shopping
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Shopping/Kilogram
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Shopping/Kilogram
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Shopping/Kilogram
      LearnWord: "\u0E01\u0E34\u0E42\u0E25"
      Translation: Kilogram
      Prompt: 'A red kitchen weighing scale with a cream dial, tick marks, a red
        needle and the dark text ''kg'', topped by a cream plate holding three round
        fruits: terracotta, olive green with a stem and mustard. Background palette:
        sand.'
    - Key: Bag
      Language: 6
      Section: Shopping
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Shopping/Bag
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Shopping/Bag
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Shopping/Bag
      LearnWord: "\u0E16\u0E38\u0E07"
      Translation: Bag
      Prompt: 'A large terracotta shopping bag with wooden rope handles and a cream
        heart logo in the center, with a teal T-shirt sticking out tilted from its
        top. Background palette: beige.'
  - Section: FamilyAndPeople
    Language: 6
    Items:
    - Key: Friend
      Language: 6
      Section: FamilyAndPeople
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/FamilyAndPeople/Friend
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/FamilyAndPeople/Friend
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/FamilyAndPeople/Friend
      LearnWord: "\u0E40\u0E1E\u0E37\u0E48\u0E2D\u0E19"
      Translation: Friend
      Prompt: 'Two friends standing side by side giving each other a high five with
        raised arms: on the left a person with spiky hair, yellow T-shirt and blue
        trousers; on the right a dark-skinned person with short hair, teal T-shirt
        and brown trousers. A gold star with three short burst lines sits between
        their raised hands at the top. Sand background.'
    - Key: Colleague
      Language: 6
      Section: FamilyAndPeople
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/FamilyAndPeople/Colleague
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/FamilyAndPeople/Colleague
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/FamilyAndPeople/Colleague
      LearnWord: "\u0E40\u0E1E\u0E37\u0E48\u0E2D\u0E19\u0E23\u0E48\u0E27\u0E21\u0E07\u0E32\u0E19"
      Translation: Colleague
      Prompt: 'Two coworkers side by side, seen from the waist up behind a long brown
        office desk with two grey laptops (seen from the back) in front of them:
        on the left a woman with a dark bob in an orange long-sleeve V-neck top,
        on the right a tan-skinned man with neat hair in a light blue short-sleeve
        shirt with white collar, waving; both wear teal ID badges on lanyards. A
        large pale blue window with four panes is behind them; a white mug on the
        left end of the desk and a small potted plant in an orange pot on the right
        end. Sky background.'
    - Key: Neighbor
      Language: 6
      Section: FamilyAndPeople
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/FamilyAndPeople/Neighbor
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/FamilyAndPeople/Neighbor
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/FamilyAndPeople/Neighbor
      LearnWord: "\u0E40\u0E1E\u0E37\u0E48\u0E2D\u0E19\u0E1A\u0E49\u0E32\u0E19"
      Translation: Neighbor
      Prompt: 'Two houses side by side separated by a short cream picket fence: a
        cream house with a red roof on the left and a pale yellow house with a blue
        roof on the right, each with a blue window and brown door. In front of the
        left house, a teen ''me'' figure (spiky hair, yellow T-shirt, teal shorts),
        small and faded to low opacity, waves; in front of the right house, highlighted
        by a glowing halo, the neighbor, a woman with darker skin, brown bob hair,
        gold earrings, green V-neck top and long tan skirt, waves back. Sage background.'
    - Key: Friend at_from_place
      Language: 6
      Section: FamilyAndPeople
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/FamilyAndPeople/Friend at_from_place
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/FamilyAndPeople/Friend at_from_place
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/FamilyAndPeople/Friend at_from_place
      LearnWord: "\u0E40\u0E1E\u0E37\u0E48\u0E2D\u0E19\u0E17\u0E35\u0E48..."
      Translation: Friend at.../from... +place
      Prompt: In the background a cream school building with a red triangular roof,
        gold chevron on the roof, a row of four blue windows, a brown door and a
        small blue flag; a large red location pin floats above it. In front, on the
        right and highlighted by a glowing halo, a dark-skinned friend with short
        hair, teal T-shirt and brown trousers waves; on the left, a teen 'me' figure
        (spiky hair, yellow T-shirt, teal shorts), smaller and faded to low opacity,
        waves back. Sage background.
    - Key: People at_
      Language: 6
      Section: FamilyAndPeople
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/FamilyAndPeople/People at_
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/FamilyAndPeople/People at_
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/FamilyAndPeople/People at_
      LearnWord: "\u0E04\u0E19\u0E17\u0E35\u0E48"
      Translation: People at...
      Prompt: 'A wide cream school-like building with a red triangular roof, gold
        chevron, a row of four blue windows, a brown door and a small blue flag,
        with a big red location pin floating above it. In front stand three small
        people in a row: on the left a tan-skinned person with short hair, blue collared
        shirt and brown trousers, waving; in the center a woman with long dark hair,
        orange V-neck top and purple skirt; on the right a dark-skinned person with
        a hair bun, green T-shirt and brown trousers, waving. Sand background.'
    - Key: Girlfriend_Boyfriend
      Language: 6
      Section: FamilyAndPeople
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/FamilyAndPeople/Girlfriend_Boyfriend
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/FamilyAndPeople/Girlfriend_Boyfriend
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/FamilyAndPeople/Girlfriend_Boyfriend
      LearnWord: "\u0E41\u0E1F\u0E19"
      Translation: Girlfriend, Boyfriend
      Prompt: 'A young couple holding hands in the center: on the left a girl with
        a dark bob, pink T-shirt and blue skirt; on the right a tan-skinned boy with
        spiky hair, teal T-shirt and brown trousers, waving with his free hand. A
        large red heart floats above them, with two smaller pink hearts beside it.
        Rose background.'
    - Key: Husband
      Language: 6
      Section: FamilyAndPeople
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/FamilyAndPeople/Husband
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/FamilyAndPeople/Husband
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/FamilyAndPeople/Husband
      LearnWord: "\u0E2A\u0E32\u0E21\u0E35"
      Translation: Husband
      Prompt: 'A married couple standing side by side: the mother (long dark hair,
        gold earrings, red short-sleeve V-neck top, long purple skirt with a gold
        band) on the left faded to low opacity, and the father (neat side-parted
        dark hair, tan skin, blue short-sleeve collared shirt, brown trousers) on
        the right fully colored and highlighted by a glowing halo. Above them in
        the center floats a gold wedding ring with a pale blue diamond, flanked by
        two small red hearts. Sky background.'
    - Key: Wife
      Language: 6
      Section: FamilyAndPeople
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/FamilyAndPeople/Wife
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/FamilyAndPeople/Wife
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/FamilyAndPeople/Wife
      LearnWord: "\u0E20\u0E23\u0E23\u0E22\u0E32"
      Translation: Wife
      Prompt: 'A married couple standing side by side: the mother (long dark hair,
        gold earrings, red short-sleeve V-neck top, long purple skirt with a gold
        band) on the left fully colored and highlighted by a glowing halo, and the
        father (neat side-parted dark hair, tan skin, blue short-sleeve collared
        shirt, brown trousers) on the right faded to low opacity. Above them in the
        center floats a gold wedding ring with a pale blue diamond, flanked by two
        small red hearts. Rose background.'
    - Key: Chief
      Language: 6
      Section: FamilyAndPeople
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/FamilyAndPeople/Chief
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/FamilyAndPeople/Chief
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/FamilyAndPeople/Chief
      LearnWord: "\u0E2B\u0E31\u0E27\u0E2B\u0E19\u0E49\u0E32"
      Translation: Chief
      Prompt: 'A leader stands large in front, highlighted by a glowing halo: a tan-skinned
        man with neat dark hair in a navy suit and trousers, white shirt and gold
        tie, one hand on his hip and the other arm raised high, with a big gold star
        and two small stars above the raised hand. Behind him, smaller and faded,
        a team of four employees with teal ID badges on lanyards (orange, green,
        purple and yellow tops), two on each side. Sand background.'
    - Key: Boss
      Language: 6
      Section: FamilyAndPeople
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/FamilyAndPeople/Boss
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/FamilyAndPeople/Boss
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/FamilyAndPeople/Boss
      LearnWord: "\u0E40\u0E08\u0E49\u0E32\u0E19\u0E32\u0E22"
      Translation: Boss
      Prompt: 'A boss sits behind a large dark-brown executive desk, seen from the
        waist up, in front of a tall dark-brown leather chair back: a tan-skinned
        man with neat dark hair and a mustache, wearing a navy suit with white shirt,
        red tie and white pocket square, both hands resting on the desk. On the desk:
        a gold nameplate, a stack of papers on the left and a teal pen cup with pens
        on the right. A framed bar chart (green, teal, gold, red bars with a rising
        red line) hangs on the wall top right. Sky background.'
    - Key: Younger sibling
      Language: 6
      Section: FamilyAndPeople
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/FamilyAndPeople/Younger sibling
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/FamilyAndPeople/Younger sibling
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/FamilyAndPeople/Younger sibling
      LearnWord: "\u0E19\u0E49\u0E2D\u0E07"
      Translation: Younger sibling
      Prompt: 'a teen ''me'' figure (spiky hair, yellow T-shirt, teal shorts) standing
        on the left, faded to low opacity, as a reference; to the right, two much
        smaller highlighted children with glowing halos waving: a little boy (spiky
        hair, blue T-shirt, brown shorts) and a little girl (pigtails with red ties,
        pink T-shirt, purple skirt); a gold arrow pointing down at the far right
        indicates ''younger''. Sand background.'
    - Key: Younger brother
