      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/FamilyAndPeople/Younger sister
      LearnWord: "\u0E19\u0E49\u0E2D\u0E07\u0E2A\u0E32\u0E27"
      Translation: Younger sister
      Prompt: 'a teen ''me'' figure (spiky hair, yellow T-shirt, teal shorts) standing
