    - Key: Older sibling
      Language: 6
      Section: FamilyAndPeople
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/FamilyAndPeople/Older sibling
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/FamilyAndPeople/Older sibling
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/FamilyAndPeople/Older sibling
      LearnWord: "\u0E1E\u0E35\u0E48"
      Translation: Older sibling
      Prompt: 'a teen ''me'' figure (spiky hair, yellow T-shirt, teal shorts) standing
        on the right, faded to low opacity, as a reference; to the left, two taller
        highlighted siblings with glowing halos waving: an older brother (short dark
        hair, green T-shirt, blue trousers) and an older sister (ponytail with a
