    - Key: Older brother
      Language: 6
      Section: FamilyAndPeople
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/FamilyAndPeople/Older brother
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/FamilyAndPeople/Older brother
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/FamilyAndPeople/Older brother
