    - Key: Older sister
      Language: 6
      Section: FamilyAndPeople
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/FamilyAndPeople/Older sister
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/FamilyAndPeople/Older sister
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/FamilyAndPeople/Older sister
      LearnWord: "\u0E1E\u0E35\u0E48\u0E2A\u0E32\u0E27"
