      Prompt: Full-body portrait of the father (neat side-parted dark hair, tan skin,
        blue short-sleeve collared shirt, brown trousers), large and centered, smiling
        and waving with one raised arm. Soft glowing halo behind him. Sky background.
    - Key: Mom
      Language: 6
      Section: FamilyAndPeople
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/FamilyAndPeople/Mom
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/FamilyAndPeople/Mom
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/FamilyAndPeople/Mom
      LearnWord: "\u0E41\u0E21\u0E48"
      Translation: Mom
      Prompt: Full-body portrait of the mother (long dark hair, gold earrings, red
