        Soft glowing halo behind her. Rose background.
    - Key: Kid of someone
      Language: 6
      Section: FamilyAndPeople
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/FamilyAndPeople/Kid of someone
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/FamilyAndPeople/Kid of someone
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/FamilyAndPeople/Kid of someone
      LearnWord: "\u0E25\u0E39\u0E01"
