    - Key: Son
      Language: 6
      Section: FamilyAndPeople
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/FamilyAndPeople/Son
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/FamilyAndPeople/Son
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/FamilyAndPeople/Son
      LearnWord: "\u0E25\u0E39\u0E01\u0E0A\u0E32\u0E22"
      Translation: Son
      Prompt: the mother (long dark hair, gold earrings, red short-sleeve V-neck
