        grey hair, round glasses, grey mustache, cream mandarin-collar top, grey-brown
        trousers), holding a brown wooden walking cane; on the right, slightly larger,
        the mother (long dark hair, gold earrings, red short-sleeve V-neck top, long
        purple skirt with a gold band) faded to low opacity, indicating the mother's
        side of the family. A dotted arc like a family-tree link connects the two
        heads, with a small red heart at its top. Rose background.
