    - Key: Grand children
      Language: 6
      Section: FamilyAndPeople
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/FamilyAndPeople/Grand children
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/FamilyAndPeople/Grand children
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/FamilyAndPeople/Grand children
      LearnWord: "\u0E2B\u0E25\u0E32\u0E19"
      Translation: Grand children
      Prompt: 'a grandmother (grey hair bun, round glasses, purple long-sleeve mandarin-collar
        top, long brown skirt) on the far left and a grandfather (receding grey hair,
        round glasses, grey mustache, cream mandarin-collar top, grey-brown trousers)
        on the far right, both faded to low opacity; in the center, highlighted by
        a glowing halo, two small grandchildren side by side waving: a little girl
        (pigtails with red ties, pink T-shirt, purple skirt) and a little boy (spiky
        hair, blue T-shirt, brown shorts), with two small gold stars above them.
        Sand background.'
    - Key: Younger brother_Sister of dad
      Language: 6
      Section: FamilyAndPeople
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/FamilyAndPeople/Younger brother_Sister of dad
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/FamilyAndPeople/Younger brother_Sister of dad
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/FamilyAndPeople/Younger brother_Sister of dad
      LearnWord: "\u0E2D\u0E32"
      Translation: Younger brother - Sister of dad
      Prompt: 'On the left, the father (neat side-parted dark hair, tan skin, blue
        short-sleeve collared shirt, brown trousers), faded to low opacity; to the
        right, two smaller highlighted figures with glowing halos waving: a young
        uncle (spiky hair, orange T-shirt, blue trousers) and a young aunt (dark
        bob, tan skin, green T-shirt, brown skirt). A gold arrow pointing down between
        their heads indicates ''younger''. Sky background.'
    - Key: Younger brother_Sister of Mom
      Language: 6
      Section: FamilyAndPeople
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/FamilyAndPeople/Younger brother_Sister of Mom
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/FamilyAndPeople/Younger brother_Sister of Mom
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/FamilyAndPeople/Younger brother_Sister of Mom
      LearnWord: "\u0E19\u0E49\u0E32"
      Translation: Younger brother - Sister of Mom
      Prompt: 'On the left, the mother (long dark hair, gold earrings, red short-sleeve
        V-neck top, long purple skirt with a gold band), faded to low opacity; to
        the right, two smaller highlighted figures with glowing halos waving: a young
        uncle (spiky hair, orange T-shirt, blue trousers) and a young aunt (dark
        bob, tan skin, green T-shirt, brown skirt). A gold arrow pointing down between
        their heads indicates ''younger''. Rose background.'
