      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/FamilyAndPeople/Older brother of mom_dad
      LearnWord: "\u0E25\u0E38\u0E07"
      Translation: Older brother of mom & dad
      Prompt: On the left, large and highlighted by a glowing halo, an older uncle
        (greying neat hair, round glasses, mustache, tan skin, green collared shirt,
        brown trousers) waving; on the right, smaller the mother (long dark hair,
        gold earrings, red short-sleeve V-neck top, long purple skirt with a gold
        band) and the father (neat side-parted dark hair, tan skin, blue short-sleeve
        collared shirt, brown trousers), both faded to low opacity. A gold arrow
        pointing up at the far left edge indicates 'older'. Sage background.
    - Key: Older sister of mom_dad
      Language: 6
      Section: FamilyAndPeople
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/FamilyAndPeople/Older sister of mom_dad
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/FamilyAndPeople/Older sister of mom_dad
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/FamilyAndPeople/Older sister of mom_dad
      LearnWord: "\u0E1B\u0E49\u0E32"
      Translation: Older sister of mom & dad
      Prompt: On the left, large and highlighted by a glowing halo, an older aunt
        (dark hair bun, gold earrings, teal long-sleeve mandarin-collar top, long
        brown skirt with a gold band) waving; on the right, smaller the mother (long
        dark hair, gold earrings, red short-sleeve V-neck top, long purple skirt
        with a gold band) and the father (neat side-parted dark hair, tan skin, blue
        short-sleeve collared shirt, brown trousers), both faded to low opacity.
        A gold arrow pointing up at the far left edge indicates 'older'. Sand background.
    - Key: In_law_for male_
      Language: 6
      Section: FamilyAndPeople
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/FamilyAndPeople/In_law_for male_
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/FamilyAndPeople/In_law_for male_
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/FamilyAndPeople/In_law_for male_
      LearnWord: "\u0E40\u0E02\u0E22"
      Translation: In-law (for male)
      Prompt: 'A row of four smaller figures: on the left a husband, the father (neat
        side-parted dark hair, tan skin, blue short-sleeve collared shirt, brown
        trousers), and his wife, the mother (long dark hair, gold earrings, red short-sleeve
        V-neck top, long purple skirt with a gold band), both faded to low opacity,
        with a gold diamond wedding ring floating above them; on the right, highlighted
        by glowing halos, the wife''s parents: a grandmother (grey hair bun, round
        glasses, purple long-sleeve mandarin-collar top, long brown skirt), waving,
        and a grandfather (receding grey hair, round glasses, grey mustache, cream
        mandarin-collar top, grey-brown trousers). A dotted arc links the wife to
        her parents. Sky background.'
    - Key: In_law_for female_
      Language: 6
      Section: FamilyAndPeople
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/FamilyAndPeople/In_law_for female_
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/FamilyAndPeople/In_law_for female_
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/FamilyAndPeople/In_law_for female_
      LearnWord: "\u0E2A\u0E30\u0E43\u0E20\u0E49"
      Translation: In-law (for female)
      Prompt: 'A row of four smaller figures: on the left a wife, the mother (long
        dark hair, gold earrings, red short-sleeve V-neck top, long purple skirt
        with a gold band), and her husband, the father (neat side-parted dark hair,
        tan skin, blue short-sleeve collared shirt, brown trousers), both faded to
        low opacity, with a gold diamond wedding ring floating above them; on the
        right, highlighted by glowing halos, the husband''s parents: a grandmother
        (grey hair bun, round glasses, purple long-sleeve mandarin-collar top, long
        brown skirt), waving, and a grandfather (receding grey hair, round glasses,
        grey mustache, cream mandarin-collar top, grey-brown trousers). A dotted
        arc links the husband to his parents. Rose background.'
  - Section: Introduce
    Language: 6
    Items:
    - Key: Hello
      Language: 6
      Section: Introduce
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Introduce/Hello
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Introduce/Hello
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Introduce/Hello
      LearnWord: "\u0E2A\u0E27\u0E31\u0E2A\u0E14\u0E35"
      Translation: Hello
      Prompt: 'A large waist-up a woman with long dark hair, gold stud earrings and
        a terracotta top in the center, happy with closed eyes, makes a Thai wai
        greeting with palms pressed together at her chest. Mustard sparkles float
        at the upper left and right, and two pink lotus flowers sit at the bottom
        corners. Background palette: rose.'
    - Key: Name
      Language: 6
      Section: Introduce
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Introduce/Name
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Introduce/Name
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Introduce/Name
      LearnWord: "\u0E0A\u0E37\u0E48\u0E2D"
      Translation: Name
      Prompt: 'A large waist-up smiling a man with short dark hair and a blue collared
        shirt in the center holds both hands at his chest, and in front of him a
        name badge: a cream card with a red header strip, a light-blue photo circle
        with a silhouette and grey text lines. Background palette: beige.'
    - Key: What_
      Language: 6
      Section: Introduce
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Introduce/What_
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Introduce/What_
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Introduce/What_
      LearnWord: "\u0E2D\u0E30\u0E44\u0E23"
      Translation: What?
      Prompt: 'A mustard-yellow gift box with a terracotta lid, a red ribbon and
        a big red bow in the lower center, with a large red question mark floating
        above it. Background palette: beige.'
    - Key: To be_People_Person from_
      Language: 6
      Section: Introduce
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Introduce/To be_People_Person from_
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Introduce/To be_People_Person from_
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Introduce/To be_People_Person from_
      LearnWord: "\u0E40\u0E1B\u0E47\u0E19 \u0E04\u0E19"
      Translation: To be + People/Person from...
      Prompt: 'A large blue globe with green continents at the bottom center, and
        a small full-body smiling a man with short dark hair and a blue collared
        shirt and dark brown trousers stands on top of it, waving. A red map pin
        at the left and a teal map pin at the right. Background palette: sand.'
    - Key: Come from
      Language: 6
      Section: Introduce
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Introduce/Come from
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Introduce/Come from
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Introduce/Come from
      LearnWord: "\u0E21\u0E32\u0E08\u0E32\u0E01"
      Translation: Come from
      Prompt: 'A blue globe with green continents on the left with a red map pin
        on it; a thick teal arc arrow curves from the pin over to the right. On the
        right a waist-up smiling a woman with long dark hair, gold stud earrings
        and a terracotta top points upward. Background palette: sky.'
    - Key: Where
      Language: 6
      Section: Introduce
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Introduce/Where
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Introduce/Where
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Introduce/Where
      LearnWord: "\u0E17\u0E35\u0E48\u0E44\u0E2B\u0E19"
      Translation: Where
      Prompt: 'A folded cream map in perspective across the lower half with a red
        dashed route line and a large red map pin with a cream center. A huge red
        question mark floats above the map. Background palette: sage.'
    - Key: What about_
      Language: 6
      Section: Introduce
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Introduce/What about_
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Introduce/What about_
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Introduce/What about_
      LearnWord: "\u0E41\u0E25\u0E49\u0E27...\u0E25\u0E30"
      Translation: What about...?
      Prompt: 'Waist-up a woman with long dark hair, gold stud earrings and a terracotta
        top on the left gestures with an open palm next to smiling waist-up a man
        with short dark hair and a blue collared shirt on the right. A small cream
        speech bubble with a red question mark at upper left, a teal arrow curving
        from it to the right, and a second small bubble at upper right with a mustard
        smiley. Background palette: sand.'
    - Key: Nice to meet you
      Language: 6
      Section: Introduce
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Introduce/Nice to meet you
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Introduce/Nice to meet you
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Introduce/Nice to meet you
      LearnWord: "\u0E22\u0E34\u0E19\u0E14\u0E35\u0E17\u0E35\u0E48\u0E44\u0E14\u0E49\u0E23\u0E39\u0E49\u0E08\u0E31\u0E01"
      Translation: Nice to meet you
      Prompt: 'Waist-up a woman with long dark hair, gold stud earrings and a terracotta
        top on the left and a man with short dark hair and a blue collared shirt
        on the right, both happy with closed eyes, reach toward each other and shake
        hands, the clasped hands shown at the bottom center. A big red heart floats
        at the top center with two smaller pink hearts beside it. Background palette:
        rose.'
    - Key: _Me_you_too_
      Language: 6
      Section: Introduce
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Introduce/_Me_you_too_
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Introduce/_Me_you_too_
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Introduce/_Me_you_too_
      LearnWord: "\u0E40\u0E0A\u0E48\u0E19\u0E01\u0E31\u0E19"
      Translation: (Me, you) too!
      Prompt: 'Waist-up a woman with long dark hair, gold stud earrings and a terracotta
        top on the left pointing and a man with short dark hair and a blue collared
        shirt on the right giving a thumbs-up, both happy with closed eyes. Above
        each of them a cream speech bubble with an identical red heart, and a teal
        equals sign between the two bubbles. Background palette: rose.'
    - Key: male_yes
      Language: 6
      Section: Introduce
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Introduce/male_yes
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Introduce/male_yes
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Introduce/male_yes
      LearnWord: "\u0E04\u0E23\u0E31\u0E1A"
      Translation: male, yes
      Prompt: 'Waist-up a man with short dark hair and a blue collared shirt on the
        right, happy with closed eyes and head tilted, speaks; faint sound-wave arcs
        at his left. A cream speech bubble at upper left contains a big green checkmark.
        Background palette: sky.'
    - Key: female_yes
      Language: 6
      Section: Introduce
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Introduce/female_yes
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Introduce/female_yes
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Introduce/female_yes
      LearnWord: "\u0E04\u0E48\u0E30, \u0E08\u0E49\u0E30"
      Translation: female, yes
      Prompt: 'Waist-up a woman with long dark hair, gold stud earrings and a terracotta
        top on the right, happy with closed eyes and head tilted, speaks; faint sound-wave
        arcs at her left. A cream speech bubble at upper left contains a big green
        checkmark. Background palette: rose.'
    - Key: A polite particle
      Language: 6
      Section: Introduce
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Introduce/A polite particle
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Introduce/A polite particle
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Introduce/A polite particle
      LearnWord: "\u0E19\u0E30"
      Translation: A polite particle
      Prompt: 'Waist-up a woman with long dark hair, gold stud earrings and a terracotta
        top on the left and a man with short dark hair and a blue collared shirt
        on the right, both happy with closed eyes and heads tilted toward each other,
        make a Thai wai with palms pressed together. Above each is a cream speech
        bubble containing a pink lotus flower. Background palette: sand.'
    - Key: Country
      Language: 6
      Section: Introduce
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Introduce/Country
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Introduce/Country
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Introduce/Country
      LearnWord: "\u0E1B\u0E23\u0E30\u0E40\u0E17\u0E28"
      Translation: Country
      Prompt: 'A large blue globe with green continents and faint grid lines stands
        on a wooden stand, with a small red flag on a dark pole planted at its upper
        right. Background palette: sky.'
  - Section: Ocupation
    Language: 6
    Items:
    - Key: Doctor
      Language: 6
      Section: Ocupation
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Ocupation/Doctor
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Ocupation/Doctor
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Ocupation/Doctor
      LearnWord: "\u0E2B\u0E21\u0E2D"
      Translation: Doctor
      Prompt: 'A tan-skinned male doctor with neat dark hair stands centered, wearing
        a white lab coat over a green top, brown trousers, and a blue stethoscope
        around his neck; he holds a brown clipboard with a white sheet of lines in
        one hand. Top right corner: a white circle with a big red medical cross.
        Sky background.'
    - Key: Masseuse
      Language: 6
      Section: Ocupation
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Ocupation/Masseuse
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Ocupation/Masseuse
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Ocupation/Masseuse
      LearnWord: "\u0E2B\u0E21\u0E2D\u0E19\u0E27\u0E14"
      Translation: Masseuse
      Prompt: A masseuse with a dark hair bun, tan skin and a green short-sleeve
        mandarin-collar top stands behind a long brown massage bed with a cream mattress,
        seen from the chest up, pressing both hands on the back of a client lying
        face down; the client shows a dark round head on the left, a bare back, and
        a pink towel with white stripes over the lower body. A purple orchid flower
        floats at upper right, with faint curved steam/relaxation lines beside the
        masseuse's head. Sage background.
    - Key: Dentist
      Language: 6
      Section: Ocupation
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Ocupation/Dentist
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Ocupation/Dentist
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Ocupation/Dentist
      LearnWord: "\u0E2B\u0E21\u0E2D\u0E1F\u0E31\u0E19"
      Translation: Dentist
      Prompt: A female dentist with a dark bob stands left of center in a white coat
        over a mint top and blue trousers, a mint surgical mask pulled down under
        her chin, raising a dental mirror (grey handle, pale blue round mirror) in
        one hand. To the right floats a large smiling white cartoon tooth with rosy
        cheeks and a pale blue shine, with three gold sparkle stars above it. Sky
        background.
    - Key: Teacher
      Language: 6
      Section: Ocupation
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Ocupation/Teacher
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Ocupation/Teacher
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Ocupation/Teacher
      LearnWord: "\u0E04\u0E23\u0E39"
      Translation: Teacher
      Prompt: A female teacher with a dark hair bun and round glasses stands on the
        right in a cream collared blouse and brown skirt, holding a blue book in
        one hand and pointing a red pointer with the other at a large blackboard
        on the upper left. The green chalkboard in a brown wooden frame shows chalk
        drawings of a triangle, a circle and a square plus two wavy lines, with a
        chalk/eraser on the ledge. Sage background.
    - Key: Police
      Language: 6
      Section: Ocupation
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Ocupation/Police
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Ocupation/Police
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Ocupation/Police
      LearnWord: "\u0E15\u0E33\u0E23\u0E27\u0E08"
      Translation: Police
      Prompt: A tan-skinned Thai police officer stands centered in a brown uniform
        (brown collared shirt with dark shoulder straps, a dark pocket flap and a
        gold badge, black belt with gold buckle, brown trousers, black shoes) and
        a brown peaked police cap with a gold emblem and black visor. One arm is
        raised holding a silver whistle near his face, with short sound lines coming
        from it. Sand background.
    - Key: Security guard
      Language: 6
      Section: Ocupation
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Ocupation/Security guard
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Ocupation/Security guard
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Ocupation/Security guard
      LearnWord: "\u0E23\u0E1B\u0E20."
      Translation: Security guard
      Prompt: 'A dark-skinned security guard stands right of center in a navy uniform:
        navy collared shirt with gold shoulder straps and a gold shield patch, black
        belt with silver buckle, dark navy trousers, black shoes, navy cap with a
        gold emblem, a black baton at his side. One hand on his hip, the other holds
        a black walkie-talkie with a mint screen and antenna at his chest. On the
        left a cream gate post with a horizontal red-and-white striped barrier arm.
        Sky background.'
    - Key: Maid_Housewife
      Language: 6
      Section: Ocupation
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Ocupation/Maid_Housewife
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Ocupation/Maid_Housewife
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Ocupation/Maid_Housewife
      LearnWord: "\u0E41\u0E21\u0E48\u0E1A\u0E49\u0E32\u0E19"
      Translation: Maid, Housewife
      Prompt: A tan-skinned woman with a dark bob stands center-left in a purple
        T-shirt and long purple skirt with a gold band, wearing a white apron with
        a pocket and pink waist trim, one hand at her chest and the other holding
        a tall wooden broom with a yellow bristle head resting on the floor to her
        right. On the left a blue bucket with pale blue water, a handle and white
        soap bubbles. Three gold sparkle stars in the upper right. Beige background.
    - Key: Pharmacist
      Language: 6
      Section: Ocupation
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Ocupation/Pharmacist
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Ocupation/Pharmacist
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Ocupation/Pharmacist
      LearnWord: "\u0E40\u0E20\u0E2A\u0E31\u0E0A\u0E01\u0E23"
      Translation: Pharmacist
      Prompt: 'A female pharmacist with a ponytail (yellow hair tie) stands centered
        in a white coat over a teal top and brown trousers, holding out an orange
        pill bottle with a white cap and white label showing a red-and-cream capsule.
        Behind her on both sides are two wooden shelves of medicine: colored bottles
        with cream caps and white boxes with colored crosses (red, blue, green, yellow,
        purple, orange, teal); the area behind her is left empty. Sage background.'
  - Section: Places
    Language: 6
    Items:
    - Key: House
      Language: 6
      Section: Places
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Places/House
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Places/House
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Places/House
      LearnWord: "\u0E1A\u0E49\u0E32\u0E19"
      Translation: House
      Prompt: 'A cozy cream house with a red triangular roof, a round attic window
        with a cross, a brick-brown chimney, two square windows and a wooden front
        door with a gold knob and a grey step. A leafy green tree stands at the left,
        a short white picket fence at the right, and small bushes in front. Background
        palette: sage.'
    - Key: Restroom
      Language: 6
      Section: Places
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Places/Restroom
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Places/Restroom
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Places/Restroom
      LearnWord: "\u0E2B\u0E49\u0E2D\u0E07\u0E19\u0E49\u0E33"
      Translation: Restroom
      Prompt: 'A restroom interior framed as a rounded rectangle with tiled walls:
        an oval mirror over a white pedestal sink with a grey faucet on the left,
        a white toilet with a tank in the center, a toilet paper holder at the right,
        and a blue men-and-women restroom sign on the upper right wall. Background
        palette: sky.'
    - Key: Kitchen
      Language: 6
      Section: Places
