        clock. Two small students stand in front at the corners: a boy with a teal
        backpack on the left and a long-haired girl with a red backpack on the right,
        both in white shirts with navy trousers or skirt. Background palette: sand.'
    - Key: Hotel
      Language: 6
      Section: Places
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Places/Hotel
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Places/Hotel
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Places/Hotel
