        six rows of three windows with cream sills. On the roof stands a cream sign
        showing a bed and three gold stars. At the bottom a glass entrance sits under
        a red canopy, flanked by small bushes in terracotta pots. Background palette:
        rose.'
    - Key: _Shop
      Language: 6
      Section: Places
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Places/_Shop
