        Shop'
      Prompt: 'Front view of a small shop: a wide rectangular building with a dark
        brown flat roof strip, a big glass display window on the left and a wooden
        door with a glass pane and gold knob on the right, a scalloped striped awning
        across the facade above the window, and a round cream sign badge on two short
        posts floating centered above the roof. Terracotta wall, blue-and-cream striped
        awning, sign shows a terracotta shopping bag. The window has a clothes rail
        with two hanging garments (plum and teal) and a shelf with a blue shopping
        bag, a mustard box and a terracotta bag; a green bush sits at the lower left
        and a cream display stand with a shopping bag icon stands in front of the
        door. Background palette: sand.'
