        a computer monitor showing a bar chart and a rising line, a keyboard, a stack
        of papers, a coffee cup and a grey office chair. On the wall are a window
        with blinds, a round clock and a shelf of colorful binders; a potted plant
        in a terracotta pot stands at the right. Background palette: beige.'
