        windows with colored header bands, the lower ones showing a bag and a cart;
        a glass entrance sits at the bottom. Two shoppers holding shopping bags stand
        at the bottom corners, a man in teal on the left and a long-haired woman
        in orange on the right. Background palette: sky.'
