        in a blue-grey uniform with a navy cap and gold badge sits behind a glass
        booth window above a wooden counter. On the counter lies an open plum passport
        with a photo and text lines on the left page and a red circular star stamp
        and a teal rectangular stamp mark on the right page, with a red-handled rubber
        stamp tilted beside it. Background palette: sky.'
    - Key: Airport
      Language: 6
      Section: Places
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Places/Airport
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Places/Airport
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Places/Airport
      LearnWord: "\u0E2A\u0E19\u0E32\u0E21\u0E1A\u0E34\u0E19"
