      Prompt: 'A passenger van stand with a blue canopy on grey posts, and a round
        blue sign on a pole at the left showing a van. A large silver-white minivan
        with a blue stripe and several windows is parked under the canopy, and a
        man in a terracotta shirt with a blue rolling suitcase waits at the left.
        Background palette: beige.'
    - Key: Taxi stand
      Language: 6
      Section: Places
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Places/Taxi stand
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Places/Taxi stand
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Places/Taxi stand
      LearnWord: "\u0E27\u0E34\u0E19\u0E41\u0E17\u0E47\u0E01\u0E0B\u0E35\u0E48"
      Translation: Taxi stand
      Prompt: 'A taxi stand with a teal canopy on grey posts covering most of the
        picture, and a round teal sign on a pole at the left showing a taxi. A large
        pink taxi with a yellow roof sign is parked under the canopy, and a man in
        a blue shirt waves to it from the left. Background palette: sand.'
    - Key: Station
      Language: 6
      Section: Places
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Places/Station
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Places/Station
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Places/Station
      LearnWord: "\u0E2A\u0E16\u0E32\u0E19\u0E35"
      Translation: Station
      Prompt: 'A cream station building with a large teal arched roof containing
        a fan-shaped glass window, a round clock in the middle and three tall arched
        glass doors below. At the left a signpost holds three arrow direction boards
        (mustard pointing right, blue pointing left, red pointing right), and a small
        traveler in a plum shirt carrying a suitcase stands at the lower right. Background
        palette: sage.'
    - Key: Train station
      Language: 6
      Section: Places
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Places/Train station
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Places/Train station
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Places/Train station
      LearnWord: "\u0E2A\u0E16\u0E32\u0E19\u0E35\u0E23\u0E16\u0E44\u0E1F"
      Translation: Train station
      Prompt: 'A tan train station building with a red roof, a central gable with
        a small clock, arched windows and a large round clock on the facade. In front,
        filling the lower part, a long cream passenger train with blue and red stripes
        and a row of windows sits on rails with wooden sleepers running across the
        bottom. Background palette: beige.'
    - Key: Sky train station
      Language: 6
      Section: Places
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Places/Sky train station
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Places/Sky train station
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Places/Sky train station
      LearnWord: "\u0E2A\u0E16\u0E32\u0E19\u0E35\u0E23\u0E16\u0E44\u0E1F\u0E1F\u0E49\u0E32"
      Translation: Sky train station
      Prompt: 'An elevated sky train station: a white train with olive and blue stripes
        and dark windows runs on a concrete platform raised on two thick grey pillars,
        sheltered by a curved teal roof on grey posts. A staircase descends diagonally
        to the ground on the left, and pale grey city towers stand in the background.
        Background palette: sky.'
    - Key: Police station
      Language: 6
      Section: Places
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Places/Police station
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Places/Police station
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Places/Police station
      LearnWord: "\u0E2A\u0E16\u0E32\u0E19\u0E35\u0E15\u0E33\u0E23\u0E27\u0E08"
      Translation: Police station
      Prompt: 'A white police station with a blue roof and a blue stripe band, two
        grids of windows on each side and a blue double door with glass panels flanked
        by two red lamps. A round cream sign with a blue shield and gold star floats
        above the roof. A white police car with a blue stripe and red-and-blue siren
        lights is parked at the lower right. Background palette: sky.'
    - Key: Post office
      Language: 6
      Section: Places
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Places/Post office
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Places/Post office
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Places/Post office
      LearnWord: "\u0E44\u0E1B\u0E23\u0E29\u0E13\u0E35\u0E22\u0E4C"
      Translation: Post office
      Prompt: 'Front view of a small shop: a wide rectangular building with a dark
        brown flat roof strip, a big glass display window on the left and a wooden
        door with a glass pane and gold knob on the right, a scalloped striped awning
        across the facade above the window, and a round cream sign badge on two short
        posts floating centered above the roof. Light cream wall, red-and-cream striped
        awning, sign shows a cream envelope. The window shows three cardboard parcels
        tied with red string and two tilted envelopes above them; a red mailbox with
        a rounded top, a slot and an envelope symbol stands at the lower left in
        front of the building. Background palette: sky.'
    - Key: Embassy
      Language: 6
      Section: Places
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Places/Embassy
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Places/Embassy
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Places/Embassy
      LearnWord: "\u0E2A\u0E16\u0E32\u0E19\u0E17\u0E39\u0E15"
      Translation: Embassy
      Prompt: 'A neoclassical embassy building with four columns, an arched brown
        door and a cream triangular pediment bearing a gold emblem with a red star.
        A flagpole rises from the roof with a waving plum flag showing a cream circle
        and gold star. A dark spiked iron fence runs across the front with two cream
        gate pillars topped by gold balls in the middle. Background palette: rose.'
    - Key: Bank
      Language: 6
      Section: Places
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Places/Bank
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Places/Bank
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Places/Bank
      LearnWord: "\u0E18\u0E19\u0E32\u0E04\u0E32\u0E23"
      Translation: Bank
      Prompt: "Front view of a classical bank building: stepped stone base, cream
        facade with four fluted columns, an arched dark brown double door in the
        center, and a triangular pediment with a large gold coin marked with the
        baht sign (\u0E3F). Stacks of gold coins sit on the ground on both sides,
        four coins on the left and three on the right. Background palette: sage."
    - Key: Gas station
      Language: 6
      Section: Places
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Places/Gas station
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Places/Gas station
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Places/Gas station
      LearnWord: "\u0E1B\u0E31\u0E4A\u0E21\u0E19\u0E49\u0E33\u0E21\u0E31\u0E19"
      Translation: Gas station
      Prompt: 'A gas station under a red canopy with a cream stripe held up by grey
        pillars, with a cream circle in the middle of the canopy showing a mustard
        fuel drop. A red fuel pump with a dark display, a fuel-drop dial and a hanging
        nozzle stands at the left, its black hose curling toward a teal car parked
        at the right. Background palette: sky.'
    - Key: Garage
      Language: 6
      Section: Places
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Places/Garage
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Places/Garage
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Places/Garage
      LearnWord: "\u0E2D\u0E39\u0E48\u0E0B\u0E48\u0E2D\u0E21\u0E23\u0E16"
      Translation: Garage
      Prompt: 'A beige auto repair garage with a dark brown roof and a round cream
        sign showing a grey wrench above it. A wide dark open garage bay with a partly
        raised grey roll-up door reveals a blue car on a grey lift inside; a stack
        of three black tires stands outside at the right. Background palette: sage.'
    - Key: Stadium
      Language: 6
      Section: Places
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Places/Stadium
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Places/Stadium
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Places/Stadium
      LearnWord: "\u0E2A\u0E19\u0E32\u0E21\u0E01\u0E35\u0E2C\u0E32"
      Translation: Stadium
      Prompt: 'An oval sports stadium seen from slightly above: grey outer wall with
        dark arched entrances, inner stands in concentric rings of red, blue and
        mustard around a green field with a white center line and center circle.
        Tall floodlight towers stand at the left and right, and four small colored
        pennant flags wave on the rim. Background palette: sky.'
    - Key: Sport court_field
      Language: 6
      Section: Places
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Places/Sport court_field
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Places/Sport court_field
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Places/Sport court_field
      LearnWord: "\u0E2A\u0E19\u0E32\u0E21 + sportname"
      Translation: Sport court/field
      Prompt: 'A green football field in perspective (narrower at the back) with
        alternating stripes, white boundary lines, a halfway line, a center circle
        and penalty boxes. A white goal net stands at the far end and a black-and-white
        soccer ball sits in the foreground at the right. Background palette: sage.'
    - Key: Swimming pool
      Language: 6
      Section: Places
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Places/Swimming pool
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Places/Swimming pool
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Places/Swimming pool
      LearnWord: "\u0E2A\u0E23\u0E30\u0E27\u0E48\u0E32\u0E22\u0E19\u0E49\u0E33"
      Translation: Swimming pool
      Prompt: 'A swimming pool seen in perspective with a cream deck around light
        blue water with white ripples. Three red-and-white lane ropes run from the
        far end toward the viewer, a red-and-white life ring floats on the left,
        a grey ladder stands at the right edge and a small white starting block sits
        at the far end. Background palette: sky.'
    - Key: University
      Language: 6
      Section: Places
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Places/University
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Places/University
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Places/University
      LearnWord: "\u0E21\u0E2B\u0E32\u0E27\u0E34\u0E17\u0E22\u0E32\u0E25\u0E31\u0E22"
      Translation: University
      Prompt: 'A grand cream university building with arched windows, a central portico
        with four columns, a triangular pediment showing a black graduation cap,
        wide front steps, and a teal dome with a gold finial on top. A graduate in
        a dark gown and mortarboard holding a rolled diploma tied with red ribbon
        stands at the lower right. Background palette: sage.'
    - Key: Bus stop
      Language: 6
      Section: Places
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Places/Bus stop
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Places/Bus stop
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Places/Bus stop
      LearnWord: "\u0E1B\u0E49\u0E32\u0E22\u0E23\u0E16\u0E40\u0E21\u0E25\u0E4C"
      Translation: Bus stop
      Prompt: 'A bus stop shelter with a teal roof, a glass back panel with a cream
        advertisement poster showing a coffee cup, and a wooden bench. A round blue
        bus stop sign on a pole with a yellow bus icon stands at the left. A man
        in an olive shirt waits under the shelter and a long-haired woman in plum
        waves at the right. Background palette: sky.'
    - Key: Temple
      Language: 6
      Section: Places
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Places/Temple
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Places/Temple
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Places/Temple
      LearnWord: "\u0E27\u0E31\u0E14"
      Translation: Temple
      Prompt: 'Front view of a Thai Buddhist temple: a cream base with steps, golden
        pillars, red arched windows and a golden-red arched doorway, under layered
        terracotta roofs edged in green with curling golden finials at the tips.
        A golden triangular gable with a red inner panel and a gold circular emblem
        sits in front of the roof. Green bushes flank the temple. Background palette:
        sand.'
    - Key: Church
      Language: 6
      Section: Places
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Places/Church
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Places/Church
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Places/Church
      LearnWord: "\u0E42\u0E1A\u0E2A\u0E16\u0E4C"
      Translation: Church
      Prompt: 'Front view of a cream church with a red gable roof and two arched
        blue windows, dominated by a tall central bell tower with a red pointed spire
        topped by a gold cross. The tower has a dark arched belfry with a gold bell,
        a round rose window with a pink center below it, and a wooden arched door
        at the base; green bushes flank the building. Background palette: sage.'
    - Key: The sea_the beach
      Language: 6
      Section: Places
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Places/The sea_the beach
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Places/The sea_the beach
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Places/The sea_the beach
      LearnWord: "\u0E17\u0E30\u0E40\u0E25"
      Translation: The sea / the beach
      Prompt: 'A seascape framed as a rounded rectangle: a wide deep-blue sea with
        rows of white waves fills most of the picture, with a red sailboat with cream
        and white sails in the center-left. A sun shines at the upper right, a white
        cloud floats at the upper left, two small seagulls fly in the sky, and a
        strip of golden sand curves along the bottom left. Background palette: sky.'
    - Key: The beach_dry area_
      Language: 6
      Section: Places
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Places/The beach_dry area_
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Places/The beach_dry area_
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Places/The beach_dry area_
      LearnWord: "\u0E0A\u0E32\u0E22\u0E2B\u0E32\u0E14"
      Translation: The beach (dry area)
      Prompt: 'A beach scene framed as a rounded rectangle: a strip of blue sea at
        the horizon under a pale sky with a sun at the upper right and a white cloud,
        and wide golden sand below. On the sand stand a red-and-cream striped beach
        umbrella on the left, a teal beach towel, a mustard sand bucket with a red
        shovel, a palm tree with coconuts at the right, an orange starfish and a
        pink seashell. Background palette: sand.'
  - Section: Prepositions
    Language: 6
    Items:
    - Key: Alley
      Language: 6
      Section: Prepositions
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Prepositions/Alley
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Prepositions/Alley
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Prepositions/Alley
      LearnWord: "\u0E0B\u0E2D\u0E22"
      Translation: Alley
      Prompt: A narrow alley in one-point perspective between two tall buildings,
        orange on the left and golden yellow on the right, with light-blue windows;
        a grey lane with a cream dashed center line leads to a cream wall at the
        far end, and a string with small red flags hangs across the top of the alley.
        Sand background.
    - Key: Area_near_row
      Language: 6
      Section: Prepositions
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Prepositions/Area_near_row
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Prepositions/Area_near_row
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Prepositions/Area_near_row
      LearnWord: "\u0E41\u0E16\u0E27"
      Translation: Area, near, row
      Prompt: 'Top-down neighbourhood: two horizontal grey roads and two rows of
        five small houses with varied roof colors (orange, brown, red, blue, yellow);
        a large translucent gold circle with a dashed dark outline marks the area
        in the center, with a red map pin in its middle. Sage background.'
    - Key: Arrive
      Language: 6
      Section: Prepositions
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Prepositions/Arrive
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Prepositions/Arrive
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Prepositions/Arrive
      LearnWord: "\u0E16\u0E36\u0E07"
      Translation: Arrive
      Prompt: Top-down short grey road ending at a red-roofed house at the top with
        a red map pin on it; a blue car has just reached the house with short cream
        motion lines behind it, and a green circle with a white checkmark to the
        right of the house; round trees around. Sage background.
    - Key: At_at exact area
      Language: 6
      Section: Prepositions
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Prepositions/At_at exact area
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Prepositions/At_at exact area
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Prepositions/At_at exact area
      LearnWord: "\u0E15\u0E23\u0E07"
      Translation: At, at exact area
      Prompt: A flat target lying on the ground seen in perspective (concentric cream
        and red ellipse rings, red bullseye), with a large blue map pin standing
        exactly in its center. Sage background.
    - Key: Behind_After
      Language: 6
      Section: Prepositions
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Prepositions/Behind_After
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Prepositions/Behind_After
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Prepositions/Behind_After
      LearnWord: "\u0E2B\u0E25\u0E31\u0E07"
      Translation: Behind / After
      Prompt: A brown wooden 3D box in front on the left, and a large red ball partly
        hidden behind its right side, peeking out; a dark arrow from the upper right
        points at the ball. Sage background.
    - Key: Beside
      Language: 6
      Section: Prepositions
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Prepositions/Beside
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Prepositions/Beside
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Prepositions/Beside
      LearnWord: "\u0E02\u0E49\u0E32\u0E07"
      Translation: Beside
      Prompt: A brown wooden 3D box on the left and a red ball sitting on the ground
        right next to its side, with a dark arrow above pointing down at the ball.
        Sage background.
    - Key: Between
      Language: 6
      Section: Prepositions
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Prepositions/Between
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Prepositions/Between
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Prepositions/Between
      LearnWord: "\u0E23\u0E30\u0E2B\u0E27\u0E48\u0E32\u0E07"
      Translation: Between
      Prompt: Two small brown wooden 3D boxes on the left and right with a red ball
        sitting in the gap between them, and a dark arrow above pointing down at
        the ball. Sage background.
    - Key: Come across_find_see
      Language: 6
      Section: Prepositions
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Prepositions/Come across_find_see
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Prepositions/Come across_find_see
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Prepositions/Come across_find_see
      LearnWord: "\u0E40\u0E08\u0E2D"
      Translation: Come across, find, see
      Prompt: A surprised person in a purple shirt on the left with raised eyebrows,
        an open O mouth and arms flung out, with little surprise lines near the head;
        a dotted line leads from them to a brown wallet with a gold clasp lying on
        the ground at right, surrounded by gold sparkles. Rose background.
    - Key: Drive
      Language: 6
      Section: Prepositions
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Prepositions/Drive
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Prepositions/Drive
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Prepositions/Drive
      LearnWord: "\u0E02\u0E31\u0E1A"
      Translation: Drive
      Prompt: A red side-view car driving to the right along a grey road strip with
        cream dashes, with a driver visible in the window, dark wheels with grey
        hubs, three horizontal speed lines behind it on the left and a yellow sun
        in the upper right. Sky background.
    - Key: End of
      Language: 6
      Section: Prepositions
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Prepositions/End of
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Prepositions/End of
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Prepositions/End of
      LearnWord: "\u0E2A\u0E38\u0E14"
      Translation: End of
      Prompt: Top-down vertical grey road that ends at the top in a cream barricade
        with red diagonal stripes on two posts; a red map pin on the road near the
        end and a thick gold arrow going up from the bottom toward it; round trees
        on both sides. Sage background.
    - Key: Go straight
      Language: 6
      Section: Prepositions
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Prepositions/Go straight
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Prepositions/Go straight
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Prepositions/Go straight
      LearnWord: "\u0E15\u0E23\u0E07\u0E44\u0E1B / \u0E15\u0E23\u0E07\u0E21\u0E32"
      Translation: Go straight
      Prompt: Top-down crossroads of two grey roads with dashed cream lines and round
        green trees in the four corners; a blue car at the bottom and a thick gold
        arrow going straight up through the intersection to a red map pin at the
        top. Sage background.
    - Key: In
      Language: 6
      Section: Prepositions
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Prepositions/In
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Prepositions/In
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Prepositions/In
      LearnWord: "\u0E43\u0E19"
      Translation: In
      Prompt: A brown open-top 3D box seen from slightly above with a dark interior,
        a red ball sitting inside it so only its upper half shows above the front
        wall, and a dark arrow above pointing down into the box. Sage background.
    - Key: In front of
      Language: 6
      Section: Prepositions
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Prepositions/In front of
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Prepositions/In front of
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Prepositions/In front of
      LearnWord: "\u0E2B\u0E19\u0E49\u0E32"
      Translation: In front of
      Prompt: A brown wooden 3D box set back on the ground and a red ball placed
        in front of it, lower and overlapping its front face; a dark arrow from the
        right points at the ball. Sage background.
    - Key: Keep at some side
      Language: 6
      Section: Prepositions
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Prepositions/Keep at some side
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Prepositions/Keep at some side
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Prepositions/Keep at some side
      LearnWord: "\u0E0A\u0E34\u0E14"
      Translation: Keep at some side
      Prompt: Top-down wide vertical grey road with a dashed cream center line and
        a solid yellow line along the left lane edge; a blue car in the left lane
        with a thick gold arrow pointing straight up, and three small dark arrows
        on the right pointing left, pushing traffic to the left side. Sage background.
    - Key: _Keep_continue
      Language: 6
      Section: Prepositions
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Prepositions/_Keep_continue
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Prepositions/_Keep_continue
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Prepositions/_Keep_continue
      LearnWord: "\u0E40\u0E23\u0E37\u0E48\u0E2D\u0E22\u0E46"
      Translation: (Keep) continue
      Prompt: Top-down winding grey road curving in an S shape from the bottom to
        the top, with a blue car at the bottom and four thick gold chevrons along
        the road pointing onward up the road; round trees around. Sage background.
    - Key: Leave from
      Language: 6
      Section: Prepositions
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Prepositions/Leave from
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Prepositions/Leave from
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Prepositions/Leave from
      LearnWord: "\u0E2D\u0E2D\u0E01\u0E08\u0E32\u0E01"
      Translation: Leave from
      Prompt: 'Top-down scene: a red-roofed house on the left with a faded brown
        map pin on it, a horizontal grey road leading away to the right, a blue car
        facing right with two small cream exhaust puffs behind it, and a thick gold
        arrow pointing right away from the house; round trees around. Sage background.'
    - Key: Left side
      Language: 6
      Section: Prepositions
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Prepositions/Left side
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Prepositions/Left side
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Prepositions/Left side
      LearnWord: "\u0E0B\u0E49\u0E32\u0E22"
      Translation: Left side
      Prompt: 'Top-down scene: a vertical grey road right of center with a blue car
        at the bottom; on the left of the road a red-roofed house with a red map
        pin, highlighted by a translucent gold band; a thick gold arrow goes up from
        the car and turns left toward that house; a small brown-roofed house and
        a tree on the opposite right side. Sage background.'
    - Key: Make a U_turn
      Language: 6
      Section: Prepositions
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Prepositions/Make a U_turn
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Prepositions/Make a U_turn
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Prepositions/Make a U_turn
      LearnWord: "\u0E01\u0E25\u0E31\u0E1A\u0E23\u0E16"
      Translation: Make a U-turn
      Prompt: Top-down wide vertical grey road with a dashed cream center line and
        round trees beside it; an orange car at the bottom of the left lane and a
        thick gold arrow that goes up, loops over in a semicircle and comes back
        down in the right lane. Sage background.
    - Key: Near
      Language: 6
      Section: Prepositions
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Prepositions/Near
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Prepositions/Near
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Prepositions/Near
      LearnWord: "\u0E43\u0E01\u0E25\u0E49"
      Translation: Near
      Prompt: A brown wooden 3D box on the left with a red ball on the ground close
        to it (small gap), a dark arrow pointing down at that ball, and a much smaller
        faded red ball far off at the right for contrast. Sage background.
    - Key: Next to
      Language: 6
      Section: Prepositions
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Prepositions/Next to
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Prepositions/Next to
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Prepositions/Next to
      LearnWord: "\u0E15\u0E34\u0E14\u0E01\u0E31\u0E1A"
      Translation: Next to
      Prompt: Two cream houses with windows and doors standing side by side, the
        left one with a brown roof and the right one with a red roof, and a dark
        arrow above pointing down at the red-roofed house. Sage background.
    - Key: On
      Language: 6
      Section: Prepositions
      WordKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Prepositions/On
      ImageKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Prepositions/On
      SoundKey: Thai/Vocabulary/Prepositions/On
      LearnWord: "\u0E1A\u0E19"
      Translation: On
      Prompt: A brown wooden 3D box centered on the ground with a red ball resting
